class LoveCompatEntry {
  const LoveCompatEntry({
    required this.score,
    required this.detail,
  });

  final int score;     
  final String detail;  
}

const Map<ZodiacSignKey, Map<ZodiacSignKey, LoveCompatEntry>> loveCompatData = {
  ZodiacSignKey.aries: {
    ZodiacSignKey.aries: LoveCompatEntry(score: 80, detail: 'You two truly make an ideal pair. Your values, thoughts, and ways of doing things are very similar, and it’s easy for you to resonate with each other and feel a natural connection. Once sparks fly, the relationship develops quickly and intensely, and it’s easy for you to stay in sync with each other’s pace. It can truly be described as love at first sight — you understand each other without needing many words. Whether in love or at work, you make the best partners. You often become so absorbed in your own little world that you forget everything around you. You really are a well-matched couple. However, you should be careful not to cling stubbornly to your own opinions or refuse to compromise, as this could lead to arguments. When you’re together, you should build a strong emotional foundation. Trust that arguments, like storms, come quickly and pass just as quickly. Keeping the relationship fresh and passionate at all times is the key to lasting love!'),
    ZodiacSignKey.taurus: LoveCompatEntry(score: 75, detail: 'You are passionate and fiery, always seeking novelty and change, while your partner is conservative, cautious, and unhurried. If the two of you take on a “forward and defender” dynamic, you can actually make quite a good pair. However, when you take the initiative in love, your partner may often seem a step slower, calmly and politely following behind you at your partner’s own pace. Don’t expect your partner to respond immediately when you express your feelings, and don’t force your partner to go along with everything you want. You need to be patient and a little more tolerant. That said, your partner is so steady and dependable. With your partner by your side, taking care of you so thoughtfully and giving without expecting anything in return, wouldn’t you feel more at ease and able to relax? If you can try to accommodate your partner a bit, and your partner avoids being overly restrictive—giving you a little more space and freedom—you can live harmoniously and happily together.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.gemini: LoveCompatEntry(score: 90, detail: 'You two are a very ideal pair. You have a good connection, share similar interests, and your mutual understanding of trends and new information becomes the driving force that pushes you both to grow and progress. Both you and your partner have very straightforward personalities. You’ll find your partner full of topics, humorous, and always having something to talk about. And your partner is deeply attracted to your energy and ambition, finding you very charming. With endless conversations between you, whether as work partners or friends, you both feel happy together. Being with your partner never feels dull or lacking in freshness. If you can both be a little more humble and willing to give way, you can learn from each other and surpass yourselves. But if both of you insist on being number one, it may cause the relationship to become tense.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.cancer: LoveCompatEntry(score: 60, detail: 'You are outgoing and straightforward, while your partner is introverted and reserved. Being together will truly require some effort from both of you, but it can also serve as a test of your endurance. Your partner is more sensitive and lacks a sense of security. When faced with difficulties, your partner may tend to avoid them. Meanwhile, once you set a goal, you charge ahead without hesitation, which can make the two of you seem somewhat out of sync. Your partner is the home-loving type, needing continuous love and reassurance, and may lack ambition and drive. You, on the other hand, enjoy adventure, dislike any form of restriction, and pursue excitement and novelty. This can make your relationship somewhat unstable, so both of you need to be more patient and tolerant with each other. In fact, if you treat your partner with respect and care, and let your partner feel your sincere love, your partner will be deeply loyal to you, attentive in every way, and truly a devoted and considerate partner.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.leo: LoveCompatEntry(score: 100, detail: 'You two can easily spark chemistry the very first time you meet, attracting each other like magnets, with the relationship progressing quickly and intensely. Your partner’s honesty, directness, and slight air of dominance make you deeply admire your partner; and your graceful, confident style is exactly to your partner’s liking. The attraction between you often feels natural and effortless. As long as you clarify your feelings for each other, the passion between you will continue without fading. However, a reminder for you both: your personalities are strong, and at times you may compete for the leading role, so conflicts are hard to avoid. This means you’ll need more communication and be careful not to let arguments escalate too far. If you manage that, you’ll be a loving, passionate, and dazzling couple. At the same time, don’t forget to work hard and earn more money, so you can enjoy life even more together!'),
    ZodiacSignKey.virgo: LoveCompatEntry(score: 70, detail: 'You and your partner have completely different personalities. You are proactive and bold, while your partner pays close attention to details and approaches everything with caution. You get extremely frustrated with your partner’s nitpicking over small details. When your partner calmly and sharply points out your shortcomings, you feel like you’re about to explode. Meanwhile, your partner can’t stand your big-picture approach—being curious about everything but sometimes lacking follow-through. Yet you’re drawn to your partner’s attentiveness and thoughtfulness, and your partner appreciates your liveliness and passion. It truly feels like a mix of love and frustration. If you want to be together, you’ll need to try to understand your partner’s repeated reminders—they are actually a genuine expression of your partner’s care for you. And your partner should also embrace your curiosity and truly appreciate the freshness and charm you bring. If you can do that, a unique and special attraction will naturally grow between you.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.libra: LoveCompatEntry(score: 80, detail: 'Your partner’s steady personality complements your bold and progressive style perfectly; you are captivated by your partner’s intelligence and wit, while your partner is deeply attracted to your brightness and cheerful nature. You are naturally different types of people, so it’s best not to expect your partner to move at the same pace as you. Don’t rush things—take it step by step to understand your partner, and at the same time allow your partner to gradually understand you. As long as you both show a little more understanding and communicate as equals with mutual respect and a willingness to learn from each other, your union can be truly wonderful; however, if communication and understanding are lacking and you focus only on each other’s shortcomings, getting along can become quite a headache.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.scorpio: LoveCompatEntry(score: 65, detail: 'You are warm and lively, while your partner appears cold on the outside but is passionate within; the two of you are like a playful leader and a king—your personalities and behaviors are completely opposite. Because you are both strong-willed and competitive, you may be drawn to your partner’s mysterious charm, and a brief spark of passion may arise, though it may not last long. If you want a lasting relationship, you must learn to be more tolerant of each other and cultivate a shared interest in the mystical or spiritual to deepen your communication. Try not to confront each other too sharply—you should tone things down a little and avoid speaking too impulsively, while your partner should express thoughts more openly instead of keeping everything bottled up. In fact, you are both highly loyal; if you can balance your differences and appreciate each other, you can build a very happy relationship.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.sagittarius: LoveCompatEntry(score: 95, detail: 'You two are truly a match made in heaven—arguing at the head of the bed and making up at the foot of it, just like playing house together. Your fiery, thrill-seeking nature and your partner’s love of adventure and tendency to crave novelty are strikingly similar, giving you equal amounts of energy and passion. You admire your partner’s idealism yet sometimes get frustrated with your partner’s strong desire for freedom; meanwhile, your partner appreciates your loyalty in always standing on the same side, but may feel overwhelmed when you become too controlling. What’s most precious is that you admire your partner’s talent, and your partner admires your intelligence—there is strong mutual attraction between you. However, be mindful that you both enjoy excitement and social activity, which can sometimes lead to a lack of deeper emotional communication and gradual distance; you are also both a bit stubborn, so you’ll need to be more tolerant of each other. Don’t force things—just let the relationship develop naturally, and it can truly last for a long time.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.capricorn: LoveCompatEntry(score: 70, detail: 'You are cheerful, passionate, proactive, and love freedom, while your partner is loyal and dependable but also conservative and stubborn. You both have strong ambition and a competitive spirit, yet you tend to lack persistence, whereas your partner is the opposite. You are not good at pretending and may find it hard to accept your partner’s quiet and steady personality, but since you sometimes lack patience, your partner can provide that stability; at the same time, you can soften your partner’s overly practical and rigid stubbornness. As you can see, there is still great potential for the two of you together. If you want to take the relationship further, it’s best to sincerely think from your partner’s perspective and show more of your gentle and considerate side. Your partner should also put aside some pride, be more accommodating, and avoid always acting like a ruler. With more heartfelt communication, you can get along quite well.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.aquarius: LoveCompatEntry(score: 85, detail: 'You are passionate and energetic, while your partner is broad-minded and cheerful, making the two of you a colorful and dazzling pair. You are intense and fiery, whereas your partner is a little cool and composed; your partner treats you well but does not pursue you in an overly passionate way. You may find it hard to fully grasp your partner, and that mystery is exactly what keeps you attracted. Your partner is also fond of your liveliness and enthusiasm, and you can sense your partner’s wisdom and intelligence, making your time together enjoyable and full of shared interests. When getting along, try not to equate the kindness your partner shows others with the kindness shown to you, so you won’t feel secretly jealous and can better appreciate how reliable your partner is. Set aside your competitive and combative instincts for a while, keep a relaxed attitude, and everything will fall into place.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.pisces: LoveCompatEntry(score: 75, detail: 'You are outgoing and passionate, while your partner is shy and lacking in confidence. Your bold and assertive nature deeply attracts your partner, and your partner’s romantic side makes you yearn for more. However, your occasional lack of focus in love may greatly anger your partner, and your partner’s emotional ups and downs can sometimes overwhelm you. Still, this can actually balance out, allowing you to complement and influence each other. Generally speaking, your relationship is warm and kind. Your bluntness might scare your partner away, so if you want to get along well, you may need to be a little gentler. Guide your partner into your inner world, let your partner feel your dreams, and combined with your partner’s romance, it will most easily create deep spiritual resonance between you. Treat each other fairly, and your journey in love will last much longer.'),
  },
  ZodiacSignKey.taurus: {
    ZodiacSignKey.aries: LoveCompatEntry(score: 75, detail: 'Your partner is passionate and always seeking change, while you are conservative, cautious, and unhurried; if the two of you take on a “forward and defender” dynamic, you can actually make quite a good pair. However, you are usually rather passive and don’t easily express your love. When your partner takes the initiative to pursue you, you may often respond a little slowly, calmly following behind at your own pace. It would be best to give some response when your partner actively shows affection, because your partner may not wait around forever. Still, you are so steady and care for your partner without expecting anything in return, and that will surely move your partner. At the same time, with your partner leading the way, you won’t have to worry so much. When you are together, don’t think about tying your partner down—give your partner more space and freedom, and you will be able to live harmoniously and happily together.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.taurus: LoveCompatEntry(score: 80, detail: 'The development of your relationship is not love at first sight, but rather like glowing embers that grow hotter and stronger over time. The process may take longer to build, yet the longer you are together, the deeper your feelings become. It may not be fiery and intense, but it can flow steadily and last for a long time. Being together is like looking into a mirror—sometimes your partner’s stubborn temper may upset you, but when you think about it, aren’t you the same at times? Therefore, both of you should let go of a little stubbornness, be more tolerant, and take a step back to see a broader horizon. In addition, both of you should take more initiative, spend more time on each other, and find ways to add more fun and romance to your lives. If you do that, you will become a very harmonious and warm couple.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.gemini: LoveCompatEntry(score: 75, detail: 'From the very beginning of your acquaintance, you both had a good impression of each other, but perhaps out of pride neither of you took the initiative to confess your feelings, so the relationship did not progress. If there were a matchmaker to give things a little push, it would likely develop at top speed. In fact, you are steady and grounded, while your partner is quick-witted and full of clever ideas, and the differences between you are quite significant; however, you have strong tolerance toward the one you love, and your partner happens to long for solid emotional support, so your pairing is actually quite good. If you like your partner, you’ll need to be more accommodating—since your partner enjoys a colorful and dynamic life, try not to be overly strict. And if your partner can better manage daily routines, be a bit more disciplined, and show you more care, your relationship can develop steadily and become something others truly admire.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.cancer: LoveCompatEntry(score: 85, detail: 'You and your partner are both relatively calm and steady people with similar values, and you both place great importance on family life. Because of this, it’s easy for you to fall in love and come together naturally, complementing each other and fulfilling your respective roles to create a happy and harmonious family. Your partner, who is content with simplicity and seeks a stable life, can give you a strong sense of security, while your unwavering loyalty once you fall in love is exactly the ultimate commitment your partner desires. However, a reminder: since you are both somewhat introverted and not very proactive, being a little more initiative-taking would make the relationship more interesting. When getting along, relax and communicate openly—“silence is golden” doesn’t quite suit the two of you. If you can do these things, you will surely build a fulfilling and affectionate life together.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.leo: LoveCompatEntry(score: 70, detail: 'You and your partner differ greatly in personality and temperament—your partner is confident, dignified, and ambitious, while you are shy and reserved. At the beginning, these contrasting traits may create a strong mutual attraction. However, over time, if you long to carefully nurture a stable relationship and immerse yourself in a warm, loving home, you may find it challenging to deal with your partner’s love of showing off and desire for admiration. Still, if you truly care for your partner, you’ll need to make an extra effort. Understand that your partner hopes to share a refined and tasteful lifestyle, so you may need to avoid being too old-fashioned or overly plain; blunt honesty may not always be well received, and offering more praise and encouragement will help your partner feel respected and admired. In return, your partner will be willing to give everything for you—just remember to be a little playful and affectionate at the right moments.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.virgo: LoveCompatEntry(score: 100, detail: 'You and your partner can truly be called a match made in heaven—your pursuit of pure and sincere love fits perfectly with your partner’s willingness to serve and care for others. At the same time, your partner keeps promises and honors commitments, which gives you great peace of mind. Your values are very similar, as you both seek a simple, stable life, dislike taking risks, and easily find spiritual fulfillment. You get along extremely well; your partner’s seriousness and reliability provide steady support behind you, and the longer you are together, the deeper your feelings grow, making it hard to part. Your relationship is the kind that grows steadily within stability. Even if it feels like a perfect score, you should still be considerate and respectful toward each other, and remain optimistic and proactive. As the saying goes, when two people are of one mind, they can cut through metal—cherish this wonderful bond you share.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.libra: LoveCompatEntry(score: 70, detail: 'Your caution and reserved nature perfectly balance your partner’s optimism and cheerfulness. In addition, you both resonate in your pursuit of beauty and aesthetics. Your tenderness and reliability are qualities your partner especially needs and appreciates. Your partner loves social life and shows vibrant energy in group settings, which makes your partner very charming. You, on the other hand, are more home-oriented, kind, and gentle; when you are together, your partner may sometimes feel that you are a bit stubborn. You also tend to be more passive, less expressive in passion, and more prone to quiet jealousy. Therefore, when you are together, you should be more tolerant and open-minded, while your partner should devote more time and care to you—this way, you will get along harmoniously. You are better suited to start as friends and let the relationship develop naturally, as that is when sparks are most likely to fly.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.scorpio: LoveCompatEntry(score: 80, detail: 'If you both pursue a bright and open kind of love, you can become an ideal couple. Your partner is highly driven and ambitious, while you are gentle and reserved; when together, you can both make each other feel secure and at ease. Your loyalty can earn your partner’s trust, and the relationship may develop very quickly. However, once you start arguing, the conflicts can become quite serious and may even lead to a prolonged cold war, so be especially mindful of that. In your daily interactions, learn from each other’s strengths, make up for each other’s weaknesses, and communicate more to avoid opposition and confrontation. As for you, try to be less jealous—being overly sour doesn’t make things sweeter. If you both think more from each other’s perspective, you will surely build a happy life together.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.sagittarius: LoveCompatEntry(score: 60, detail: 'You are someone who seeks a stable and peaceful life, while your partner prefers to be unconventional and chase excitement and novelty—your attitudes toward life are completely different. Your partner’s restlessness and love of fun may make you feel uneasy and overwhelmed, while your calmness and lack of interest in indulgent pleasures may be hard for your partner to tolerate. If one of you is willing to compromise, there is still hope for the relationship. For example, if your partner can accept a more ordinary and steady life with you, or if you can be more accommodating and give your partner enough space and freedom. Ideally, your partner should also learn to keep promises, especially regarding dates, and manage finances wisely. You might consider building your relationship on a stable material foundation first—once practical matters are secure, emotional connection and mutual understanding can gradually deepen over time, growing richer with age, allowing you to get along harmoniously and become a rather good couple.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.capricorn: LoveCompatEntry(score: 95, detail: 'You and your partner are both steady and hardworking types, making you a highly compatible and well-coordinated pair. Your relationship may not be dramatic or stormy, but instead grows steadily and naturally, fitting together like magnets. Your shared sense of loyalty in love gives your relationship a promising future. Your partner can discover your gentle and playful side, while you appreciate your partner’s sincerity and reliability. With aligned thoughts and goals, you are willing to endure hardships and are not driven by vanity—you don’t need luxury restaurants, designer brands, or imported cars, as long as your spiritual and emotional lives are fulfilling. However, this simplicity can also have its downside, so it’s important to add a little more fun, tenderness, and romance to your everyday life. If you plan your future thoughtfully together, you can surely build a happy and harmonious family.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.aquarius: LoveCompatEntry(score: 65, detail: 'You and your partner have somewhat similar foundations, yet clear differences in outlook. You are introverted, steady, gentle, conservative, and highly practical—a true realist who values tangible results. Your partner, on the other hand, embraces innovation and avant-garde ideas, is broad-minded and imaginative, and carries an idealistic, even anti-traditional spirit, which can sometimes make communication more challenging. However, you may both share a deep interest in music, art, or aesthetics, and these creative pursuits can help bring you closer together. Your partner’s thoughts may be as unpredictable as the wind, so when getting along, you will need plenty of patience and resilience. It’s important to appreciate your partner’s uniqueness, be tolerant of your partner’s broad affections, and avoid being overly possessive. By learning to admire each other’s different temperaments and strengths, you can improve your relationship and help your feelings grow steadily.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.pisces: LoveCompatEntry(score: 90, detail: 'You and your partner both tend to act from the heart, and your relationship usually develops in a gentle atmosphere without placing too much pressure on each other. Once you move past the initial stage of getting to know one another, your feelings often grow naturally; your resilience combined with your partner’s thoughtfulness can make you a deeply understanding, warm, and sweet pair. In your eyes, your partner is kind and courteous, while your partner appreciates your reliability and steadiness, finding a strong sense of security in you. You can learn from your partner’s more metaphysical and intuitive sensitivity, avoiding becoming overly focused on material desires, while your partner can learn from your practical and grounded approach, preventing drifting into confusion or unrealistic fantasies. Your personalities complement each other well, creating a mutually supportive dynamic. Even so, you should communicate frequently to avoid extreme differences in viewpoints that could become difficult to resolve.'),
  },
  ZodiacSignKey.gemini: {
    ZodiacSignKey.aries: LoveCompatEntry(score: 90, detail: 'You and your partner are truly an ideal match. You share a strong mutual attraction and similar interests, and your shared awareness of trends and new information becomes the driving force that pushes both of you to grow and progress. You both have straightforward personalities; your partner finds you talkative, humorous, and endlessly engaging, while you are deeply attracted to your partner’s energy and ambition, seeing great charm there. With constant topics to discuss, whether as work partners or companions, you both feel happy together, and being with your partner never feels dull or lacking in freshness. If you take the initiative to help realize your partner’s dreams, this approach to your relationship will surely make you even more compatible and closely connected.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.taurus: LoveCompatEntry(score: 75, detail: 'From the very beginning of your acquaintance, you and your partner felt a mutual attraction; as long as one of you can put aside pride and take the initiative to confess your feelings, your relationship will surely develop steadily. If there happens to be a matchmaker to give things a little push, it may even progress at top speed. In your eyes, your partner is extremely charming, so you may very well take the initiative to show affection. In fact, your partner is steady and grounded, while you are quick-witted and full of clever ideas—the differences between you are quite noticeable; however, your partner has great tolerance toward the one your partner loves, and you happen to long for strong emotional support. Therefore, your pairing is actually a very good one.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.gemini: LoveCompatEntry(score: 80, detail: 'When you see your partner, it feels as though you’re seeing yourself—there’s a strong sense of familiarity, and your thoughts and feelings about many things are remarkably similar. Together, you can fully express your clever, adaptable personalities, even enhancing each other’s strengths, making you a deeply connected and vibrant pair with a colorful life. However, a reminder: your combination is not necessarily flawless. Because you understand each other so well, you can clearly see—and easily magnify—each other’s shortcomings; sometimes, with just the slightest hint, you can sense what your partner is thinking, and this can become a hidden danger in your relationship. Since you are both naturally curious, you should be careful to avoid emotional distractions or shifting affections. Therefore, it’s important for both of you to build a strong sense of responsibility toward each other in order to maintain a healthy and lasting relationship.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.cancer: LoveCompatEntry(score: 75, detail: 'You are outgoing and changeable, while your partner is introverted and sensitive. Although there seem to be significant differences between you, your closeness—like neighboring signs—creates a special kind of connection, as if proximity naturally brings intimacy, and there is a subtle chemistry between you. Your partner’s sensitivity and patience can balance your rationality and restlessness, while your broad knowledge and intelligence can easily win your partner’s admiration. You can learn a great deal from each other, which is truly wonderful. However, over time, you may begin to feel that your partner’s sensitivity and possessiveness are restrictive, while your sociable, novelty-seeking nature and ability to navigate different circles with ease may make your partner uneasy. As long as you appreciate each other’s strengths and avoid careless criticism, your love life can certainly remain sweet and warm.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.leo: LoveCompatEntry(score: 85, detail: 'You and your partner both love social life, making you a mutually attracted and appreciative pair. You are deeply drawn to your partner’s open and upright demeanor and trustworthy attitude, while your partner admires your wit and charm, allowing intimacy to grow quickly between you. You are well-liked and tactful in handling matters, and you know how to respect your partner’s natural leadership presence, which satisfies your partner’s desire to lead; in turn, your partner’s boldness and broad-mindedness can tolerate your occasional restlessness, enabling you to complement each other’s strengths and weaknesses very well. However, there may be times when you feel your partner is a bit domineering and that keeping up can be tiring, so it’s important to maintain emotional balance. Remember to sustain good communication and interaction, continually stimulating and adjusting to each other, as this will make your relationship even closer.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.virgo: LoveCompatEntry(score: 70, detail: 'You and your partner are both sensitive and intellectual, so when you first meet there is a natural attraction—your partner’s analytical mind easily captures your attention and admiration, while your ability to absorb knowledge quickly and broadly wins your partner’s appreciation. However, your personality is changeable while your partner is meticulous and cautious; you may aspire to shine in social circles, whereas your partner focuses more on practicality; your partner thinks in a calm and orderly way, while you tend to think in leaps and jumps. These two different types may spark quickly at the beginning, but sustaining a steady, long-term relationship can take effort. Your lack of follow-through in experimentation and execution may frustrate your partner, while you may strongly dislike your partner’s criticism and attention to trivial details. Therefore, it’s important for both of you to first build mutual trust. Especially for you, your words and actions need to be consistent in order to strengthen the relationship.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.libra: LoveCompatEntry(score: 100, detail: 'You and your partner are both modern and intellectual, and your time together feels pleasant, relaxed, and never overly clingy. In many situations, your thoughts align effortlessly, showing strong mutual understanding. You are also an outgoing and dynamic pair—versatile, colorful, and quite eye-catching. Your partner tends to see everything as art or a game, and is usually very accepting of your changeable yet intellectual nature; both of you enjoy the harmonious affection you share. Even if small disagreements arise occasionally, they quickly fade away. If you can be a little more attentive toward your partner, and your partner can offer you more tolerance and affection, your pairing can become truly perfect.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.scorpio: LoveCompatEntry(score: 60, detail: 'You are lively and changeable, while your partner is deep and sharp, so it may be difficult for you to find common ground. Your way of thinking and acting tends to be spontaneous and jumpy, which can feel like a huge gap to your partner, who prefers focus and intensity in everything. As a result, even though you are quick-witted, you may still find it hard to handle your partner at times. However, your partner’s strong emotions, devotion, and mysterious aura are qualities you lack, and they may deeply attract you; likewise, your partner can easily be captivated by your clever and agile charm. Over time, though, you must pay special attention to mutual understanding. Try to understand the emotions hidden within your partner’s heart and avoid giving your partner reasons for suspicion. There is no need to deliberately please your partner—just let things develop naturally. If your partner can also relax a little and avoid placing too many restrictions or pressures on you, you can still get along harmoniously.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.sagittarius: LoveCompatEntry(score: 80, detail: 'You and your partner are both cheerful and outgoing. Your partner enjoys your knowledgeable conversations, while you are attracted to your partner’s frank and straightforward attitude. You both move at a quick, agile pace and share a strong desire to pursue new knowledge, which creates mutual attraction. In fact, you may feel more like kindred spirits. However, at times your partner’s unpredictability may leave you feeling lonely, and your partner may occasionally think your pursuit of intellectual growth and spiritual exploration is a bit excessive. This requires both of you to make an effort to find balance so that you can achieve harmony both mentally and emotionally. Since you admire in each other the qualities you yourselves may lack, it’s important to truly respect and accept those differences. If you don’t learn to complement each other’s strengths and weaknesses and grow together, communication may become difficult and create a sense of opposition between you.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.capricorn: LoveCompatEntry(score: 65, detail: 'You are lively and changeable, while your partner is stubborn and traditional, giving you completely different personalities. However, one thing you share is a strong sense of pride and self-respect. When you first meet, you may find your partner’s traditional nature refreshingly different, and your partner may be charmed by your imaginative ideas and joyful spirit. But if you want the relationship to last, you’ll need to make good use of your communication skills and flexibility, strengthen your sense of responsibility, and cultivate greater perseverance and patience, while letting go of occasional exaggeration and developing a more practical mindset. Then, in a respectful tone, encourage your partner to relax a little and gradually build trust in you. By doing so, it will be much easier to close the distance between you and create a more relaxed and pleasant relationship.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.aquarius: LoveCompatEntry(score: 95, detail: 'You and your partner both belong to the intelligent, forward-thinking, trendsetting type—able to talk about everything from astronomy to geography, sometimes even feeling as though you met too late in life. It’s easy for you to develop mutual understanding and appreciation, opening your hearts to each other and forming a cheerful, free-spirited pair. Your relationship feels natural and relaxed, with both of you enjoying enough independent space to breathe without pressure. However, since you are both playful and active, you still need to set aside time for each other amid your busy lives; even with strong chemistry, you must nurture your feelings to prevent your sense of connection from fading. You love to express ideas and your partner enjoys debate, and with mutual understanding already in place, as long as you trust each other and share new experiences and feelings, your love will naturally remain vibrant and colorful.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.pisces: LoveCompatEntry(score: 70, detail: 'Changeability and a love of freedom are traits you and your partner share; however, the difference is that you possess keen intuition, while your partner is sensitive and romantic. In your eyes, your partner may seem lacking in confidence yet self-sacrificing and kind, appearing indecisive, sentimental, and vulnerable; meanwhile, your partner may feel that your constant desire for novelty and change makes you seem unsettled and unable to provide a sense of security. If you can both make good use of your shared love of freedom and adaptability, you can bring variety into your lives and engage in deeper communication, gradually drawing closer to each other. By reducing your tendency to handle things superficially, you can also lessen the negative impact of your partner’s habit of muddling through and hiding true feelings. With mutual understanding and adjustment, you can still become a wonderfully harmonious couple.'),
  },
  ZodiacSignKey.cancer: {
    ZodiacSignKey.aries: LoveCompatEntry(score: 60, detail: 'You are introverted and reserved, while your partner is outgoing and straightforward, so being together will truly require some effort from both of you—and it can also test your endurance. You tend to be sensitive and lack a sense of security, often retreating when things don’t go smoothly; meanwhile, once your partner sets a goal, your partner charges ahead without hesitation, which can make you seem out of sync. You are the home-loving type, needing continuous love and reassurance, somewhat passive, lacking initiative, and even a little clingy; in contrast, your partner enjoys adventure, dislikes restrictions, and seeks excitement and novelty. This difference can make your relationship unstable, so you both need to be more tolerant. In fact, if you try not to be overly emotional, practice greater understanding, and give your partner more freedom and space to thrive, you will come to feel your partner’s sincere love.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.taurus: LoveCompatEntry(score: 85, detail: 'You and your partner are both relatively calm and steady people with similar values, and you both place great importance on family life. Because of this, it’s easy for you to fall in love and come together naturally, complementing each other and fulfilling your respective roles to build a happy and harmonious family. Your partner seeks a stable life and can give you a strong sense of security, and once in love, your partner’s rock-solid loyalty is exactly what you ultimately desire; your partner is also very satisfied with your gentleness and thoughtfulness. However, a reminder for you: since you are both somewhat introverted, being a little more proactive would make the relationship more interesting. When getting along, relax and communicate openly—“silence is golden” doesn’t really suit the two of you. If you can do these things, you will surely create a fulfilling and affectionate life together.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.gemini: LoveCompatEntry(score: 75, detail: 'Your partner is outgoing and changeable, while you are introverted and sensitive. Although there seem to be significant differences between you, your closeness—like neighboring signs—creates a special connection, as if proximity naturally brings intimacy, and there is a subtle chemistry between you. Your sensitivity and patience can balance your partner’s rationality and restlessness, while your partner’s broad knowledge and intelligence can easily win your heart. You can learn a great deal from each other, which is truly wonderful. However, over time, your partner may feel that your sensitivity and possessiveness are restrictive, while your partner’s novelty-seeking social style and ability to thrive in different circles may make you feel uneasy and jealous. As long as you appreciate each other’s strengths and avoid careless criticism, your love life can certainly remain sweet and warm.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.cancer: LoveCompatEntry(score: 80, detail: 'You and your partner have extremely similar personalities and values, forming a relationship built on mutual belonging and reliance. From the very beginning, you may feel like old friends—comfortable and naturally understanding each other; since you are both sensitive and affectionate, you can comfort one another easily, sometimes even knowing what is on each other’s mind without asking. However, being overly sensitive can also have negative effects, as small misunderstandings may be misjudged and lead to unhappiness for both of you. In addition, since you are both home-oriented, your activities together may become limited to a small circle, and over time this could lead to boredom. It would be best to engage more with the outside world, as atmosphere and variety are important in adding charm and vitality to your lives. Also, try not to bring up unpleasant matters from the distant past, as doing so can easily create tension between you.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.leo: LoveCompatEntry(score: 75, detail: 'You are gentle and reserved, while your partner is proud and bold; together, your pairing can maintain a perfect balance and shine brilliantly. Your partner may appear confident and even arrogant on the outside, yet deep down can easily feel lonely—this vulnerability is hidden beneath a dazzling exterior and is rarely noticed; your nurturing and sensitive nature can gently help your partner lay down that armor and truly relax. To you, your partner represents passion and hope, and your partner’s strong pursuit can indeed satisfy you, allowing you to fully enjoy the feeling of being loved. As long as you respond with warmth and consideration without becoming overly clingy, your partner will gladly soften and cooperate; and if your partner can also tone things down a little and let go of some pride, the two of you can build a truly happy family together.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.virgo: LoveCompatEntry(score: 90, detail: 'You and your partner can truly be described as an elegant and warm pair that others admire. At first glance, you may seem playful and carefree together, laughing and teasing, but beneath that lighthearted surface there is deep mutual understanding and strong chemistry, allowing you to share a relaxed and harmonious atmosphere. You dislike superficial romance and long for a stable, calm relationship, while your partner is calm and well-planned, with a passionate heart that also needs recognition and appreciation. Your partner strives for perfection and believes everything should follow logic and order, usually holding high standards personally—something that aligns with your own conscientious and steady nature. Since you are both somewhat introverted and not inclined to pursue love aggressively, your relationship often begins from friendship. Additionally, because you are both sensitive, it is especially important to build strong mutual trust.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.libra: LoveCompatEntry(score: 65, detail: 'You are sentimental, imaginative, and introverted, while your partner leans toward artistic tastes and is active and changeable, so at first glance you may seem to have little in common. You are not the kind of pair who instantly click with perfect chemistry. However, your partner’s naturally refined sense of aesthetics can become even more creative when inspired by your love and sensitivity. In addition, you are understanding, strong-willed, and patient. If, while walking hand in hand with your partner, you can be more open-minded and confident, and your partner can be sincere and learn to cultivate greater steadiness so that you feel secure, the two of you can still get along very well and build a happy future together.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.scorpio: LoveCompatEntry(score: 100, detail: 'Your nurturing and warm temperament paired with your partner’s mysterious charm makes you a dazzling couple. From the moment you first meet, there is a natural sense of connection, and as you grow closer, the mutual understanding and appreciation between you only deepen. If you meet after both having gained life experience, you will understand and commit to each other even more profoundly, sometimes knowing each other’s thoughts without a single word. With such spiritual harmony, you can fully enjoy a mature and fulfilling love. Your partner’s view of love aligns well with your need for protection and security; your partner’s passion and romance can truly satisfy your emotional needs and soothe your inner unease, while your loyalty and wholehearted devotion will earn your partner’s reliance. Since your values are aligned and you can empathize with each other, if you fall in love, your relationship is sure to last for a long, long time.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.sagittarius: LoveCompatEntry(score: 70, detail: 'You are home-oriented while your partner prefers the outdoors; you are sensitive and reserved, whereas your partner is passionate and expressive. Usually, your ideal partner is someone serious and grounded, yet your partner tends to be elusive—hard to predict and difficult to grasp. In this sense, you represent two extremes; although you may seem complementary, you might not naturally move in sync. However, if you share a common career or goal, you will gain a shared language, which can help bridge the distance between you. It may be wise to first focus on developing your own paths; once material stability is established, emotional connection and mutual understanding can gradually grow. Over time, affection deepens—like fine wine, it becomes richer and smoother with age. One more thing to remember: when you are together, try to open yourself up and enrich your life experiences; your partner will be drawn to that vibrant side of you.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.capricorn: LoveCompatEntry(score: 80, detail: 'When you first meet, you are usually easily attracted to each other. Your partner is fascinated by your gentleness and understanding nature, while you feel a sense of security in your partner’s fatherly authority and cautious, steady personality. Although aside from both being somewhat introverted and conservative your traits are mostly opposite, and the relationship may not appear intensely passionate on the surface, the distance between you can close quickly, allowing you to rely on each other. Your partner is very self-disciplined and tends to expect others to set aside emotions as well, so when getting along, try not to be overly emotional; instead, relax a little and take the initiative to use your tender sensitivity to soften your partner. In addition, both of you should communicate more—your partner should avoid being too demanding, and you should express your thoughts openly. By doing so, you can surely enjoy a harmonious relationship.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.aquarius: LoveCompatEntry(score: 70, detail: 'You are emotional and guided largely by your feelings, while your partner is rational and objective; you hope for devoted love and to hold your beloved close, whereas your partner is broad-hearted and values friendship deeply, believing affection should not be confined to just one person. Your ways of thinking are also polar opposites—your partner’s vision of a beautiful new world may seem unbelievable to you; you may admire your partner’s ideals and insights, yet struggle to accept a partner who appears stubborn and hard to persuade. In fact, you are better suited to begin as friends and gradually let friendship evolve into love. When getting along, try to be calmer and more rational, and tone down emotional reactions; give your partner enough space and don’t mistake your partner’s broad affections for unfaithfulness. When your partner doesn’t interfere with your interests or personal space, it doesn’t mean a lack of care—that is simply your partner’s way of expressing love.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.pisces: LoveCompatEntry(score: 95, detail: 'From the very first meeting, you and your partner may feel love at first sight, mutually attracted and naturally drawn together, forming a deeply romantic and tender pairing. You are loving and enjoy helping and caring for others, while your partner truly knows how to appreciate you, making your time together feel blissful. Your partner is often gentle and humble, almost like a sponge absorbing your grievances and soothing your worries. Since you are both highly sensitive, it’s easy for you to fall in love quickly. However, because you are both emotional and mild by nature, your moods may fluctuate, so it’s important to add a bit more rationality and cultivate optimism and confidence. You can inspire your partner’s artistic talents at the right moments and offer strong emotional support, while your partner can be even more attentive and provide you with a solid sense of security—together, this will make your relationship even more perfect.'),
  },
  ZodiacSignKey.leo: {
    ZodiacSignKey.aries: LoveCompatEntry(score: 100, detail: 'You and your partner can easily spark chemistry the very first time you meet, attracting each other like magnets, with the relationship progressing quickly and intensely. Your charm, confidence, and straightforward nature make your partner deeply admire you, while your partner’s generosity and decisiveness perfectly match your taste. The attraction between you often feels natural and effortless—once you clarify your feelings for each other, the passion between you can remain strong and lasting. However, a reminder: both of you have strong personalities and may compete for leadership at times, so conflicts are hard to avoid. This means you’ll need to communicate more and be careful not to let arguments escalate too far. If you manage that, you will be a loving, passionate, and dazzling couple—and of course, working hard and earning more will help you enjoy life together even more.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.taurus: LoveCompatEntry(score: 70, detail: 'You and your partner differ greatly in personality and temperament—you are confident and dignified, while your partner is cautious and reserved. At the beginning, these contrasting qualities may create a strong mutual attraction. However, over time, you may grow frustrated with your partner’s silence combined with a strong sense of possessiveness, while your partner may find it difficult to tolerate your self-assured manner and your liking for admiration and praise. If you truly want to be together, you may need to slow down, restrain your pride, and avoid sounding commanding when you speak; meanwhile, your partner should offer you appropriate praise and encouragement so that you feel valued and respected. When two people are together, it’s important not to cling to pride—treat each other as equals and practice mutual understanding, and only then can you build a truly happy and fulfilling life together.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.gemini: LoveCompatEntry(score: 85, detail: 'You and your partner both love social life, making you a mutually attracted and appreciative pair. Your partner is deeply drawn to your generous confidence, radiant charm, and trustworthy attitude, while you admire your partner’s wit and humor, allowing intimacy to develop quickly. Your partner is well-liked and tactful in handling matters, and knows how to respect your strong sense of pride, which satisfies your desire to lead; meanwhile, your generosity and open-mindedness can tolerate your partner’s occasional restlessness, enabling you to complement each other’s strengths and weaknesses very well. However, at times your partner may feel that you are a bit domineering, so you may need to soften your approach to maintain balance. Remember to maintain good communication and interaction, continually adjusting and inspiring each other, as this will make your relationship even closer.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.cancer: LoveCompatEntry(score: 75, detail: 'Your partner is introverted and gentle, while you are proud and passionate; together, your pairing can maintain a perfect balance and shine brilliantly. You may appear confident and even a little arrogant on the outside, yet deep down you can easily feel lonely—this vulnerability is hidden beneath your dazzling exterior and is rarely noticed; your partner’s nurturing and sensitive nature can gently help you lay down your armor and truly relax. To your partner, you represent passion and hope, and your strong pursuit can indeed satisfy your partner, allowing your partner to fully enjoy the feeling of being loved. As long as you tone things down a little and set aside some pride, and your partner responds with warmth and consideration without being overly possessive while offering more praise and affirmation, the two of you can build a truly happy family together.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.leo: LoveCompatEntry(score: 80, detail: 'You and your partner are both energetic, cheerful, and radiant—exactly the type each of you admires in a significant other—so it’s no surprise that you leave a wonderful impression on each other at first sight. Your pleasant and easygoing temperaments allow you to enjoy life together, making your pairing passionate, glamorous, and full of flair. However, a reminder: since your personalities are so similar—equally outgoing and bold—you may also share traits of stubbornness and pride, and when dissatisfied, neither of you tends to hold back. Therefore, when getting along, remember that your partner is just like you—strong in self-esteem and sensitive about pride—so avoid competing for dominance or embarrassing each other openly. A lack of respect can lead to serious consequences. As long as you treat each other with mutual respect, you can live a happy and fulfilling life together like royalty.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.virgo: LoveCompatEntry(score: 75, detail: 'You are radiant and captivating, while your partner is delicate and elegant, so it’s easy for you to fall in love at first sight. Your partner is drawn to your cheerful and generous attitude, and you appreciate your partner’s precise and analytical mind, which can support your career development. However, after spending more time together, you may find your partner critical and overly picky, which can frustrate you; meanwhile, your partner may feel that you are too open and self-assured, leading to dissatisfaction. Therefore, when getting along, you should be especially mindful of your words and actions, as your partner strives for perfection. Try setting aside some pride and accepting your partner’s critical spirit—it is often simply a matter of focusing on facts rather than personal attacks. If you can tone things down a little, your partner will admire you even more and become your strongest advisor and most reliable supporter in carrying out plans. As long as you hold onto the goal of growing together for the long term, a lasting partnership is well within reach.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.libra: LoveCompatEntry(score: 85, detail: 'You and your partner are truly an ideal match. Your partner is indifferent to fame and fortune and carries a peaceful nature, while you are like a radiant princess, bright as a sunflower, with an active and outgoing personality; you admire each other and naturally complement one another. You both enjoy lively gatherings and being part of groups, and your values and attitudes toward life are quite similar. If you can set aside a little pride for love, soften your strong presence, and show more gentleness and consideration, while your partner takes charge of the bigger picture, offers you more advice, praise, and encouragement, tempers natural charm with sincerity, and expresses genuine love more openly, the two of you will enhance each other beautifully and enjoy a life filled with sweetness together.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.scorpio: LoveCompatEntry(score: 70, detail: 'You are passionate, bold, and carry a natural air of leadership, while your partner is strong-willed and uncompromising, cool on the outside but intense within; both of you have powerful personalities, except yours is openly expressed and your partner’s is deeply concealed. When you are together, everything tends to be dramatic and intense—once you clash, it can feel like thunder striking fire, quickly becoming uncontrollable. However, there is always the risk of explosive conflict. You prefer to speak your mind directly, while your partner is more reserved, observing first before forming conclusions, and may see you as exaggerated or overly dramatic; in turn, you may find your partner hard to understand or even somewhat calculating. You would benefit from being more open-minded and showing your partner the warmth and brightness behind your strength. If you can truly cherish and understand each other, you will form a formidable and powerful pair; but if both of you stubbornly insist on your own views and create opposition, it will be difficult to grow closer.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.sagittarius: LoveCompatEntry(score: 95, detail: 'You and your partner easily resonate with each other, and from the very first meeting your connection can surge to its peak, making you a healthy, cheerful, love-at-first-sight kind of pair. Both of you pursue freedom and an uninhibited lifestyle, and because you can respect each other and make small compromises, you are an ideal match—one that others may envy. You can fill certain inner voids through your partner’s optimism and openness, while your partner appreciates your straightforward way of speaking, which feels light and free of pressure. When you are together, you’re like two playful children, making the most of everything around you and interacting as if starring in an exaggerated and lively drama. Still, don’t rely solely on your natural compatibility and forget the importance of communication.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.capricorn: LoveCompatEntry(score: 60, detail: 'You are bold and somewhat domineering, while your partner is melancholic and meticulous, making your dynamic seem a bit mismatched. Both of you have strong personalities and intense ambition—except you compete openly, while your partner strategizes more subtly. You pursue authority and enjoy leading, whereas your partner seeks achievement and aims for the summit; each of you wants to take the dominant role. You value pride and rarely give in, and although your partner may appear patient, there may be quiet plans forming beneath the surface. Even so, your partner genuinely admires your sunny and vibrant spirit, and while you may complain that your partner lacks romance, you still appreciate your partner’s determination and steadfast individuality. As long as you communicate more, adjust your approaches, and learn to recognize and affirm each other’s strengths, you have strong potential to build a promising future together.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.aquarius: LoveCompatEntry(score: 80, detail: 'You are brave and cheerful, while your partner is calm and rational. You admire your partner’s individuality and originality, and your partner loves your talent and fearless spirit—these qualities create a wonderful opportunity for your relationship to grow, so cherish it. If you truly come together, you can become passionate, fiery lovers. However, be mindful that since both of you want to take the leading role, conflicts are almost inevitable; if neither of you is willing to step back, insisting on your own views may ultimately lead to saying goodbye. Instead, strive to understand each other, complement each other’s strengths and weaknesses, and show mutual respect. Love requires sacrifice, dedication, and tolerance. If you can appreciate each other’s strengths and build a relationship founded on trust, your love can surely last for a long time.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.pisces: LoveCompatEntry(score: 65, detail: 'You are bold and passionate, while your partner is gentle and refined. At first, you may be attracted to each other’s uniqueness, but after spending more time together, you may realize that your personalities do not quite align and that true complementarity may be limited. However, if you truly care for your partner, you may need to soften your strong, dominant stance and avoid sounding aggressive, as your partner dislikes conflict; if you keep pressing for answers, your partner will be even less likely to open up. In fact, your partner greatly admires your determination and drive, as long as you make the effort to understand your partner’s thoughts. Set aside some pride—your partner doesn’t ask for much, only a touch of tenderness and romance. When you are together, try not to appear overly forceful, and your partner should also learn to face issues directly instead of avoiding them. If both of you put in sincere effort, you can gradually close the distance between you.'),
  },
  ZodiacSignKey.virgo: {
    ZodiacSignKey.aries: LoveCompatEntry(score: 70, detail: 'You and your partner have completely different personalities—your partner loves adventure and is proactive and bold, while you pay close attention to details and approach everything with caution. Your partner feels extremely frustrated by your nitpicking over small matters, and when you calmly and sharply point out your partner’s shortcomings, your partner may feel ready to explode. Meanwhile, you cannot stand your partner’s carelessness, endless curiosity, and tendency to start things without finishing them. Yet your partner is drawn to your attentiveness and thoughtfulness, and you admire your partner’s passion and bold spirit. It truly feels like a mix of love and frustration. If you want to be together, you will need to accept your partner’s curiosity and genuinely appreciate the freshness and charm your partner brings; at the same time, your partner should try to understand your repeated reminders and recognize that they are sincere expressions of your care. In doing so, a unique and special attraction will naturally grow between you.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.taurus: LoveCompatEntry(score: 100, detail: 'You and your partner can truly be described as a match made in heaven. Your partner pursues pure and sincere love, which fits perfectly with your caring and service-oriented nature. At the same time, you honor your mutual promises, giving your partner great peace of mind. Your values are very similar—you both seek a simple and stable life, dislike taking risks, and easily find emotional fulfillment. You get along extremely well; your seriousness and reliability provide steady support behind your partner, and the longer you are together, the deeper your feelings grow, making it harder to part. Yours is a relationship that grows steadily within stability. Even if it feels like a perfect score, you should still be considerate and respectful toward each other, and remain optimistic and proactive. As the saying goes, when two people are of one mind, they can cut through metal—cherish this wonderful bond you share.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.gemini: LoveCompatEntry(score: 70, detail: 'You and your partner are both sensitive and intellectual, so when you first meet there is a natural attraction—your analytical mind easily draws your partner’s attention and admiration, while your partner’s speed and breadth in absorbing knowledge win your favor. However, your partner is changeable in personality, while you are meticulous and cautious; your partner aspires to shine socially, whereas you prioritize practicality; you think in a calm and orderly way, while your partner’s thinking style is more spontaneous and jumping. These two different types may spark quickly at the beginning, but sustaining a steady, long-term relationship can take effort. Your partner’s lack of follow-through in experimenting and executing ideas may frustrate you, while your partner strongly dislikes your criticism and constant reminders. Therefore, it is important for both of you to first build mutual trust.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.cancer: LoveCompatEntry(score: 90, detail: 'You and your partner can truly be described as an elegant and warm pair that others admire. At first glance, you may seem playful and carefree together, laughing and teasing, yet beneath that lighthearted surface there is deep mutual understanding and strong chemistry, allowing you to share a relaxed and harmonious atmosphere. Your partner dislikes superficial romance and longs for a stable, calm relationship, while you are calm and well-planned, with a passionate heart that also seeks recognition and appreciation. You strive for perfection and believe that everything should follow reason and order, often holding yourself to high standards—something that aligns with your partner’s conscientious and steady nature. Since you are both somewhat introverted and not inclined to pursue love aggressively, your relationship often begins from friendship. Additionally, because you are both sensitive, it is especially important to build strong mutual trust.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.leo: LoveCompatEntry(score: 75, detail: 'Your partner is dignified and confident, while you are gentle and refined, making it easy for you to fall in love at first sight. You are drawn to your partner’s open and broad-minded attitude, and your partner appreciates your precise and analytical mind, believing it can support future ambitions. However, after spending more time together, you may feel that your partner is overly open and self-assured, which can leave you dissatisfied; meanwhile, your partner may find your critical and picky tendencies hard to tolerate. Therefore, when getting along, it’s important for you to preserve your partner’s pride in any setting and be generous with praise—your partner is naturally suited for the spotlight, and as long as you don’t embarrass your partner publicly, your partner won’t feel threatened by your success. Of course, if your partner can also tone things down a little, you will admire your partner even more and feel at ease. As long as you both focus on building a lasting bond, a long-term partnership is well within reach.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.virgo: LoveCompatEntry(score: 80, detail: 'You and your partner share remarkably similar personalities, and the more you look at each other, the more comfortable and familiar you feel, as if seeing your own reflection. You both appreciate honesty, thoughtfulness, and dedication in a partner, and being together feels harmonious and naturally compatible—without a doubt, you make an ideal match. However, neither of you tends to be proactive, so if neither takes the initiative to express feelings, progress may be slow. Since you both care deeply about each other’s feelings and hold high standards for yourselves, getting along can sometimes feel a bit demanding; it’s also easy to assume that your partner feels exactly the same as you do, and if that assumption proves untrue, it can be hurtful. In truth, you should both practice empathy, offer more appreciation and affirmation, trust in the love you share, and be less critical—this will help you create a sweeter and warmer life together.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.libra: LoveCompatEntry(score: 75, detail: 'The flavor of your love lies largely in savoring each other’s sweet words. You are easily enchanted by your partner’s artistic aura, while your partner is drawn to your intelligence and sincerity. Your partner seeks balance and harmony, while you are delicate yet strong-willed—though you represent two different types, you are still able to understand each other. Your partner may sometimes seem close yet distant, with an attitude that feels like a mix of love and friendship, while you quietly express your care through actions rather than words. Since you are both thoughtful and analytical, try not to pursue perfection excessively and be more understanding toward each other; likewise, your partner should avoid debating too much or overthinking—if your partner can simply be more honest with you, you will naturally offer space and freedom without trying to hold your partner back. If you coordinate well, you can become a truly ideal couple.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.scorpio: LoveCompatEntry(score: 85, detail: 'You and your partner are both steady and hardworking types; you are deeply devoted in love, and your partner is equally affectionate, with both of you holding strong loyalty toward relationships, making you a highly compatible pair who can rely on each other. Your partner’s attentiveness and careful nature resemble yours, and your partner’s depth, wisdom, potential, and touch of mystery are qualities you respect and admire; in turn, your partner appreciates your faithfulness and down-to-earth attitude toward love. When you are together, it’s important for you to understand your partner’s cool exterior and warm heart. Your partner often keeps emotions contained and handles feelings calmly and steadily, so you may need to tone down tendencies to dwell on trivial matters; if your partner can also open up more and share heartfelt thoughts with you, it will greatly strengthen your bond. Remember to communicate often and give each other some space—this will make your love even more solid and enduring.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.sagittarius: LoveCompatEntry(score: 65, detail: 'You are gentle, refined, meticulous, and introverted, while your partner is passionate, expressive, and sometimes a little careless and impulsive. You may feel attracted to each other at first meeting, but differences in values can quickly create a noticeable sense of distance. You strive for perfection and like to choose carefully; once you fall in love, you expect devotion and may become somewhat clingy, hoping your partner will always be by your side. However, your partner takes a more carefree approach to life, falls in love easily, and can just as easily shift focus, making your partner hard to grasp. Loving freedom and disliking restrictions, your partner may find it difficult to give up the whole forest for a single tree. Still, if you truly care for your partner, you must not only be sincere but also act swiftly; try to align your actions with your partner’s rhythm, show genuine care and consideration, and most importantly, give your partner enough freedom.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.capricorn: LoveCompatEntry(score: 95, detail: 'You and your partner are not the overly romantic type—steadiness and practicality are your shared strengths. Your attentiveness and gentleness are especially attractive to your partner, while you admire your partner’s ambition, composure, and strategic thinking, which give you a strong sense of security and stability. You both see each other as someone with whom you can discuss work and plan for the future. Even in silence, you can intuitively sense each other’s feelings, showing deep mutual understanding. Although your relationship may not be filled with dramatic passion or sparks, your love can flow steadily and endure over time. However, to make your bond even stronger, it’s important to set shared goals and work hard to build financial stability; with a solid foundation and compatible personalities, a lasting and loving partnership will be well within reach.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.aquarius: LoveCompatEntry(score: 60, detail: 'When you first meet, it may feel as though you have endless topics to talk about, and you both feel happy together. You may be attracted to your partner’s creativity, while your partner admires your intelligence and clarity of mind. However, over time, dissatisfaction can gradually arise. You are rational and calm, approaching things with analysis and careful consideration, while your partner is curious, good at reasoning, and pioneering in spirit, creating a significant gap in your ways of thinking. As time passes, your partner may feel that you are too practical and lacking in imagination, and that you hold on too tightly; meanwhile, you may see your partner as unrealistic. Still, if you truly want to be together, you should try to understand your partner better and avoid putting too much pressure on your partner, while your partner can devote more emotional attention to you. With mutual effort, you can still look forward to a bright future together.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.pisces: LoveCompatEntry(score: 80, detail: 'You are serious and strive for perfection, while your partner is intuitive and imaginative—two completely different types. Precisely because of this contrast, a strong attraction can easily arise between you. Yet once you truly begin living and interacting together, you may also discover areas of friction. You may admire your partner’s romantic aura but feel frustrated by your partner’s tendency toward wastefulness or lack of discipline; meanwhile, your thoughtfulness, careful consideration, and sincere devotion deeply move your partner, yet your partner may feel constrained by your rigid, by-the-book approach. This means you both need to practice mutual respect and love, calmly facing differences with tolerance, learning from each other’s strengths, and making up for your own shortcomings. You can appreciate your partner’s artistic spirit without being overly practical and shattering your partner’s dreams, while your partner should treat you with genuine sincerity and consistency. In this way, you can become a truly harmonious and well-balanced couple.'),
  },
  ZodiacSignKey.libra: {
    ZodiacSignKey.aries: LoveCompatEntry(score: 80, detail: 'Your partner’s bold and progressive style complements your steady personality beautifully; you are deeply attracted to your partner’s brightness and cheerfulness, while your partner is captivated by your intelligence and wit. Since you are naturally different types of people, it’s best not to expect your partner to move at the same pace as you. Don’t rush the process—take time to understand your partner step by step, and allow your partner to gradually understand you as well. As long as you both cultivate greater understanding and communicate as equals with mutual respect and a willingness to learn from each other, your union can be truly wonderful; however, if communication and understanding are lacking and you focus only on each other’s shortcomings, getting along can become quite a headache.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.taurus: LoveCompatEntry(score: 70, detail: 'Your partner’s caution and reserved nature balance your optimism and cheerfulness, and you also resonate deeply in your shared appreciation of beauty. Your partner’s humor and reliability are qualities you especially value and need. You love social life and display vibrant energy in group settings, which makes you highly charming. In contrast, your partner is more home-oriented, mature, and steady, and at times you may feel that your partner is somewhat stubborn. Your partner may also be less proactive, less expressive in passion, and occasionally prone to quiet jealousy. Therefore, when you are together, you should devote more time and care to your partner, while your partner should practice greater tolerance and open-mindedness—this will help you get along harmoniously. You are better suited to begin as friends and let the relationship develop naturally, as that is when sparks are most likely to ignite.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.gemini: LoveCompatEntry(score: 100, detail: 'You and your partner are both modern and intellectual, and your time together feels pleasant, relaxed, and never overly clingy. In many situations, your thoughts align effortlessly, showing strong compatibility. You are also an outgoing and dynamic pair—versatile, colorful, and highly eye-catching. You tend to view everything as art or play, and you are usually very accepting of your partner’s changeable yet intellectual nature; both of you enjoy the harmonious affection you share. Even if small disagreements arise occasionally, they quickly fade away. If you can better align yourself with your partner’s actions, and your partner can be more attentive toward you, your pairing can become truly perfect.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.cancer: LoveCompatEntry(score: 65, detail: 'Your partner is full of ideas, imaginative, and somewhat introverted, while you are drawn to art and are active and energetic, so at first glance you may seem to have little in common. You are not the kind of pair who instantly click with effortless chemistry. However, your naturally refined sense of aesthetics can become even more creative when inspired by your partner’s love and sensitivity. In addition, your partner possesses great tolerance along with strong willpower and patience. If, while walking hand in hand with your partner, you can be sincere and cultivate a bit more steadiness so that your partner feels secure, and your partner can also become more open-minded and confident, the two of you can get along very well and build a happy future together.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.leo: LoveCompatEntry(score: 85, detail: 'You and your partner are truly an ideal match. Your meeting is like a natural-born star encountering nobility—both of you know how to “perform” in life. You can be seen as the best audience on your partner’s life stage; your partner enjoys taking the lead role, while you act as a peacemaker, perfectly suited to support and highlight your partner’s brilliance. You both love lively environments, social circles, and group activities, sharing similar values and attitudes toward life. If you can become your partner’s strongest supporter, share the leisure activities you enjoy, and express your genuine love more openly, while your partner is willing to set aside a bit of pride and offer more sweet words and affection, you will complement each other beautifully and enjoy a life filled with sweetness together.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.virgo: LoveCompatEntry(score: 75, detail: 'The sweetness of your love lies largely in savoring each other’s tender words. You are easily attracted to your partner’s intelligence and sincerity, while your partner is enchanted by your artistic aura. You seek balance and harmony, while your partner is delicate yet determined—though you represent two different types, you are still able to understand each other well. Your partner may not openly confess love, choosing instead to show care through actions, while you sometimes seem close yet distant, with an attitude that feels like a blend of love and friendship. Since you are both thoughtful and analytical, try not to argue excessively or overthink; if you are more open and honest with your partner, your partner will naturally give you space and freedom without trying to restrain you. Likewise, your partner should avoid being overly perfectionistic and practice greater understanding. If you coordinate well, you can become a truly ideal couple.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.libra: LoveCompatEntry(score: 80, detail: 'You and your partner both have a deep understanding of life and greater insight than most, making you perceptive and thoughtful individuals. Your values and ideas are highly aligned, which makes communication between you smooth and natural. To others, you appear to be a perfectly matched pair; however, if your past life experiences differ significantly, you may need some time to adjust and truly resonate with each other. When building a life together, both of you should practice patience and compromise, avoiding placing yourselves on too high a pedestal. Since you both value perfection, try focusing more on each other’s strengths—this will help create a more harmonious and fulfilling relationship.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.scorpio: LoveCompatEntry(score: 75, detail: 'You are attracted to your partner’s charm, and your partner feels a desire to win you over, so there is strong mutual attraction between you. However, if endurance is lacking, the relationship may begin quickly and fade just as fast. Your partner is intensely magnetic, reacting passionately to those who are close, like a strong, rich wine, and when in love, your partner can be like flowing lava, with a powerful sense of possessiveness. You may appear passionate on the surface, yet deep down you can be emotionally guarded and hesitant about giving your heart fully. When getting along, you may need to tone down your tendency to treat everyone equally warmly, while your partner should try to be more open-minded. It’s best not to be swept away solely by surface attraction; if you wish for the relationship to last, let it develop naturally and take time to truly understand each other.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.sagittarius: LoveCompatEntry(score: 90, detail: 'You and your partner both enjoy pleasure and a free-spirited lifestyle, so being together brings vitality and fun; even if one of you treats the relationship playfully at times, the other usually won’t take it too seriously. Your partner’s easygoing nature may seem especially charismatic to you, while your calm composure is something your partner deeply admires. You appreciate and are drawn to each other, making you a very promising and ideal pair. However, remember this: while you can respect your partner’s carefree style and enjoy a relationship free from excessive pressure, if you truly want your love to last and grow steadily, both of you must cultivate a stronger sense of responsibility. By applying wisdom and mutual understanding, you can build a happy and fulfilling life together.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.capricorn: LoveCompatEntry(score: 65, detail: 'When you meet, you are easily attracted to each other’s different qualities and may quickly feel a spark, yet this does not necessarily mean true mutual appreciation. You admire your partner’s steadiness, ambition, ideals, and refined taste, while your partner is impressed by your natural poise in social settings and your ability to keep emotional distance in a way that captivates others. However, a sudden spark without genuine admiration makes it difficult to build a lifelong relationship. If you choose to be together, you will need to learn to coordinate and adapt to one another. In fact, you can make an excellent working team—your partner’s ambition and careful planning are qualities you may lack, while your strength in handling relationships and your relaxed approach to life are exactly what your partner needs. If you value what you complement in each other and put in sincere effort, there is definitely a promising future ahead.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.aquarius: LoveCompatEntry(score: 95, detail: 'When you meet, you both instinctively feel that the other is the partner you have long dreamed of; without needing many words, you can sense deep affection and fully experience both loving and being loved, making you an ideal pair. You both have restless souls, and your combination feels like both lovers and friends at the same time—balancing emotion and reason in a uniquely special way. You naturally create interaction and mutual understanding, and once truly together, you can give each other ample space while remaining harmonious and steady without drifting apart. Still, you should aim to be both a friend and lover to your partner without being overly controlling, while your partner should show you more care and attention, as you deeply need emotional warmth. If you begin as friends and let the relationship grow without pressure, you can enjoy a joyful connection and move toward lasting love together.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.pisces: LoveCompatEntry(score: 60, detail: 'On the surface, you and your partner may seem gentle and steady, yet in truth you come from very different inner worlds. Both of you are easily loved and also easily fall in love, which can create a sense of instability when you are together. However, if you truly choose to love each other, you can become a romantic and highly creative pair. As tender-hearted romantics, you are naturally drawn to one another; as long as you offer each other more support and a stronger sense of security, your relationship can become more stable. Make an effort to communicate and exchange thoughts more openly, and overcoming your innate differences will not be difficult. By placing yourselves in each other’s shoes more often, harmony and steadiness will follow naturally.'),
  },
  ZodiacSignKey.scorpio: {
    ZodiacSignKey.aries: LoveCompatEntry(score: 65, detail: 'Your partner is passionate and expressive, while you may seem cool on the outside but warm within; together you are like a queen and a playful leader, with completely opposite personalities and behaviors. Since you are both competitive and strong-willed, your partner may be drawn to your mysterious charm, sparking a brief but intense passion that may not last long at first. If you hope to build a lasting relationship, you must learn to be more tolerant and perhaps cultivate shared spiritual or deeper interests to strengthen your communication. Try not to confront each other too sharply—you should express your thoughts openly instead of keeping them bottled up, while your partner should tone things down and avoid constantly trying to control you. In truth, you are both highly loyal, and if you can balance your differences and genuinely appreciate each other, you can create a very happy and fulfilling relationship together.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.taurus: LoveCompatEntry(score: 80, detail: 'If you and your partner both pursue a bright and open kind of love, you can become an excellent couple. You are strong-willed and persistent, qualities your partner deeply admires, while your partner’s maturity and steadiness give you a sense of security and ease. Your partner’s loyalty can earn your trust, and the relationship may progress very quickly. However, when arguments arise, they can be intense and may even lead to a prolonged cold war, so this is something you should be especially mindful of. In daily interactions, learn from each other’s strengths, make up for each other’s weaknesses, and communicate more to avoid opposition and confrontation. You should share your thoughts more openly with your partner, and your partner should show greater confidence and avoid unnecessary jealousy. If you both think more from each other’s perspective, you can certainly build a happy life together.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.gemini: LoveCompatEntry(score: 60, detail: 'You are mysterious and profound, while your partner is lively and changeable, so it may seem difficult for you to find common ground. Your partner’s way of thinking and acting tends to be spontaneous and jumping, which can feel like a huge gap to you, since you prefer focus and depth in everything. Even so, you may be captivated by your partner’s clever and agile charm, while your strong emotions, devotion, and aura of mystery—qualities your partner lacks—deeply attract your partner in return. Over time, however, mutual understanding becomes essential. If you can relax a little and avoid placing too many restrictions or pressures on your partner, and if your partner makes an effort to understand the emotions hidden within your heart, avoids giving you reasons for doubt, and doesn’t try too hard to please you but simply lets things flow naturally, you can still build a harmonious and fulfilling relationship together.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.cancer: LoveCompatEntry(score: 100, detail: 'Your mysterious charm paired with your partner’s nurturing and warm temperament makes you a dazzling couple. From the very first meeting, you are likely to feel an instant connection, and as your relationship deepens, the mutual understanding and appreciation between you will grow even stronger. If you meet after both having gained life experience, you will understand and commit to each other more profoundly, often sensing each other’s thoughts without needing words. With such spiritual harmony, you can fully enjoy a mature and fulfilling love. Your view of love aligns beautifully with your partner’s deep need for security; your passion and romance can truly satisfy your partner and soothe inner insecurities, while your partner’s loyalty and wholehearted devotion will earn your trust and reliance. Since your values are aligned and you can empathize with each other, if you fall in love, your relationship is sure to last for a long, long time.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.leo: LoveCompatEntry(score: 70, detail: 'You are strong-willed and uncompromising, cool on the outside but passionate within, while your partner is bold, enthusiastic, and carries a natural air of leadership—the difference is that your intensity is hidden deep inside, whereas your partner expresses it openly. When you are together, everything tends to be dramatic and intense; once you clash, it can feel like thunder striking fire, quickly becoming uncontrollable. However, there is always the risk of explosive conflict. You are reserved and prefer to observe before forming conclusions, which may lead you to see your partner as exaggerated or showy; meanwhile, your partner prefers to speak directly and may view you as hard to understand or even somewhat calculating. If you can truly cherish and understand each other, you will form a powerful and formidable pair; but if both of you stubbornly insist on your own views and create opposition, it will be difficult to grow closer.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.virgo: LoveCompatEntry(score: 85, detail: 'You and your partner are both steady and hardworking types; your partner is deeply devoted, and you are equally affectionate, with both of you highly loyal in love, making you a very compatible pair who can rely on each other. Your attentiveness and careful nature are much like your partner’s, and your depth, wisdom, potential, and touch of mystery are qualities your partner respects and admires; in turn, you appreciate your partner’s faithfulness and down-to-earth attitude toward love. When you are together, if you can open your heart and share your true feelings with your partner, and your partner understands your cool exterior and warm heart, your bond will grow stronger. Since you often keep emotions composed and handle them calmly, it would help if your partner tones down overly trivial habits, which will further enhance your relationship. Remember to communicate often and give each other space—this will make your love even more solid and enduring.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.libra: LoveCompatEntry(score: 75, detail: 'Your partner is drawn to your mysterious charm, and you feel a desire to conquer your partner, so there is strong mutual attraction between you. However, if endurance is lacking, the relationship may begin quickly and fade just as fast. You are mysterious and strong, reacting intensely to those close to you like a rich, potent wine, and you long for complete devotion, with a powerful sense of possessiveness in love. Your partner may appear warm and kind to everyone, yet deep down can be emotionally reserved and hesitant about committing fully. When getting along, you may need to be more open-minded, while your partner should tone down the habit of being equally attentive to everyone—especially to the opposite sex. It’s best not to be swept away solely by surface attraction; if you hope for a lasting relationship, let it develop naturally and take time to truly understand each other.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.scorpio: LoveCompatEntry(score: 80, detail: 'You and your partner share similar traits—both strategic, reserved, and possessing a mysterious charm—so when you meet, the attraction is immediate and intense, making it hard to part; once in love, the passion can feel explosive and dramatic. However, since you both appear cool on the outside and dislike openly expressing your inner thoughts, one of you must take the initiative to speak up, or you may miss a beautiful opportunity. You are both devoted and strongly possessive, and jealousy can easily arise; when things are good, your understanding feels effortless, but when problems surface, you may withdraw and fall into a cold war. It would be wise to begin as friends and establish healthy communication patterns—don’t assume that natural chemistry eliminates the need for conversation. By being more honest with each other and making good use of your keen insight and ambition, you can strengthen not only your relationship but also your shared success in life.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.sagittarius: LoveCompatEntry(score: 75, detail: 'Your partner is optimistic, humorous, and passionate, while you are strong, steady, strategic, and quietly reserved. Your partner is a true optimist who believes in personal ability and good fortune regardless of the outcome, and is action-oriented, especially fond of sports. These qualities are quite attractive to you, and you are often moved by your partner’s lively enthusiasm; meanwhile, your air of mystery sparks your partner’s desire to pursue and understand you. However, you tend to be more controlling and possessive, whereas your partner values freedom and adventure and dislikes any form of restriction. In your relationship, you may need to practice greater tolerance and try to accept your partner’s free-spirited lifestyle, perhaps even integrating into your partner’s social world; in turn, your partner should show you more care and pay attention to communicating with sensitivity. If you coordinate well, you can become a very compatible and rewarding couple.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.capricorn: LoveCompatEntry(score: 90, detail: 'You and your partner have similar personalities, both reserved and steady in nature. From the very beginning, you can almost see through each other’s thoughts at a glance, and when you are together, there is no need for pretense—there is simply a sense of comfort and security between you. If your life goals are aligned, your partner may feel inspired by you, unlocking hidden potential and becoming more adventurous instead of rigid, while you can accomplish more with your partner’s unity and support—especially the valuable help your partner offers in your work. However, a reminder: since you both tend to focus quietly on your goals and keep emotions within, even if you can sense each other’s feelings, a relationship still needs tenderness and affection expressed outwardly. Communicate more openly—keeping everything bottled up may eventually lead to emotional outbursts.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.aquarius: LoveCompatEntry(score: 70, detail: 'You are rigorous and practical, while your partner values freedom and tends to be idealistic. There is an elusive attraction between you, sometimes even a sudden spark of electricity. However, your differences are significant in many areas—you may see your partner’s broad affections as unfaithfulness and view your partner’s ideas as unrealistic fantasies; meanwhile, your partner may feel that your jealousy and strong possessiveness are suffocating. If you truly want to be together, there is still real hope. In fact, you both possess strong determination, especially when it comes to carrying out your own will and striving to surpass yourselves. It would be beneficial to create shared goals and interests. If you can focus on these common pursuits, you still have a strong chance of becoming a lasting pair.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.pisces: LoveCompatEntry(score: 95, detail: 'You and your partner are both highly sensitive with strong intuition—often a glance or a subtle gesture is enough to communicate everything, creating a deep spiritual connection between you. Your partner’s gentle nature, rich imagination, and selfless spirit are exactly what you, being devoted and somewhat possessive, desire; meanwhile, your partner, who finds it hard to refuse others and tends to be mild and accommodating, deeply admires your calm approach to life—especially your ability to reject meaningless matters with quiet authority. However, even though your understanding is strong, you should still be mindful in daily life: you may need to offer your partner more care and support to avoid unintentionally causing hurt, while your partner should strengthen emotional resilience, as avoiding issues rarely solves them. By adding a little more romance and playfulness to your peaceful and steady life, your love can remain both sweet and enduring.'),
  },
  ZodiacSignKey.sagittarius: {
    ZodiacSignKey.aries: LoveCompatEntry(score: 95, detail: 'You and your partner are truly a match made in heaven—arguing at the head of the bed and making up at the foot of it, just like playing house together. Your partner’s fiery, thrill-seeking nature and your independent, novelty-loving personality are strikingly similar, giving you equal amounts of energy and passion. Your partner admires your idealism yet sometimes feels frustrated by your strong love of freedom; meanwhile, you appreciate your partner’s loyalty in always standing on the same side, though you may feel overwhelmed when your partner becomes too controlling. What’s most precious is that your partner admires your talent, and you admire your partner’s intelligence—there is strong mutual attraction between you. However, be mindful that since you both enjoy lively environments, you may sometimes neglect deeper emotional communication, which could gradually create distance; you are also both a bit stubborn, so greater tolerance is needed. Don’t force things—just let the relationship develop naturally, and it can truly last for a long time.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.taurus: LoveCompatEntry(score: 60, detail: 'Your partner seeks a stable and peaceful life, while you prefer to be unconventional and pursue excitement and novelty, so your attitudes toward life are completely different. Your energetic and playful nature may make your partner feel uneasy and overwhelmed, while your partner’s reserved lifestyle and lack of indulgence in enjoyment may be hard for you to tolerate. If one of you is willing to compromise, there is still hope for the relationship—for example, if you can accept a calmer, steadier life with your partner, or if your partner can cherish and support you by giving you enough space and freedom. Ideally, you would keep your promises and honor your commitments, while your partner works hard to provide material security. You might consider building your relationship first on a stable material foundation; once practical matters are secure, emotional connection and mutual understanding can gradually deepen over time, growing richer and smoother, allowing you to get along harmoniously and become a rather good couple.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.gemini: LoveCompatEntry(score: 80, detail: 'You and your partner are both cheerful and outgoing. You enjoy your partner’s knowledgeable conversations, while your partner is attracted to your optimism and straightforward attitude. You both move at a quick, agile pace and share a strong desire to pursue new knowledge, creating mutual attraction. In fact, you may feel more like kindred spirits than anything else. However, at times your unpredictability may make your partner feel lonely, and you may sometimes feel that your partner’s pursuit of intellectual and spiritual growth goes a bit too far. This calls for mutual effort to find balance so that both of you can achieve emotional and mental harmony. Since you admire in each other the qualities you may lack yourselves, it is important to truly respect and accept those differences. If you do not learn to complement each other’s strengths and grow together, communication may become difficult and lead to a sense of opposition between you.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.cancer: LoveCompatEntry(score: 70, detail: 'Your partner is more home-oriented, while you are more outdoorsy; your partner tends to be sensitive and reserved, whereas you are passionate and expressive. Usually, your partner hopes for a serious and steady ideal match, yet you can seem elusive—appearing and disappearing unpredictably, making it hard for your partner to grasp you fully. In this sense, you are two extreme types; although you may appear complementary, you are not naturally in sync. However, if you share a common career or goal, you will have shared ground to connect on, which gives you a good chance to grow closer. It would help to focus first on developing your individual careers; once material stability is established, emotional connection and mutual understanding can gradually deepen. Over time, affection can grow richer—like fine wine, becoming more fragrant and full-bodied the longer it matures.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.leo: LoveCompatEntry(score: 95, detail: 'You and your partner easily resonate with each other, and from the very first meeting the spark between you can instantly reach its peak—it’s a love-at-first-sight, vibrant and uplifting combination. You both pursue freedom and a bold way of living, and you are able to respect each other while making small compromises, making you an ideal pair and the kind of couple others admire. You can easily fill certain emotional gaps through your partner’s optimism and openness, while your partner appreciates that you speak your mind without creating pressure or emotional burden. When you are together, you’re like two playful children, making the most of your surroundings for fun, and your dynamic can feel like an exaggerated and lively drama. Still, don’t rely too much on your natural compatibility—good communication is essential to keep the relationship strong.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.virgo: LoveCompatEntry(score: 65, detail: 'Your partner is gentle, refined, rigorous, and introverted, while you are passionate, expressive, and at times a little careless and impulsive. You may feel attracted to each other at first, but soon the differences in your values and outlooks could create a noticeable sense of distance. Your partner pursues perfection, carefully selecting everything, and once in love expects exclusivity and devotion. You, on the other hand, cherish freedom and dislike being confined—it is hard for you to give up an entire forest for a single tree, and you feel that sudden excitement and adventure make life more enjoyable. However, your partner struggles to accept anything that strays too far from structure or routine. This means you both need to adjust and cooperate: you could be more thoughtful and reassuring, allowing your partner to feel secure while joining in your adventures, and your partner can show more care and understanding by giving you space and freedom. Wouldn’t that make for a much happier relationship?'),
    ZodiacSignKey.libra: LoveCompatEntry(score: 90, detail: 'You and your partner both enjoy pleasure and a free-spirited lifestyle, so being together brings energy and fun. Even if one of you just wants to play around a little, the other is unlikely to take it too seriously. Your optimism, open-mindedness, and easygoing nature make you especially charming in your partner’s eyes, while you deeply appreciate your partner’s calmness and composure. You admire and are attracted to each other, making you a very promising and ideal pair. Still, a gentle reminder: your partner may respect your carefree spirit and avoid placing too many restrictions or pressures on you, but if you want the relationship to last and grow steadily, both of you need to build a shared sense of responsibility. Use your wisdom together, and you can surely create a happy and fulfilling life side by side.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.scorpio: LoveCompatEntry(score: 75, detail: 'You are optimistic, humorous, and passionately expressive, while your partner is strong, steady, strategic, and quietly reserved. You are a true optimist—no matter the outcome, you believe in your own abilities and luck, and you are full of action-oriented energy, especially when it comes to sports and staying active. These qualities are very attractive to your partner, who is often moved by your lively enthusiasm; at the same time, your partner’s mystery sparks your curiosity and desire to draw closer. However, your partner tends to be more controlling and possessive, while you value freedom and adventure and dislike feeling restricted. For this relationship to work well, you should be more attentive and mindful, especially in the way you communicate; meanwhile, your partner needs to practice patience and tolerance, learning to accept your free-spirited lifestyle and ideally becoming part of your social world. If you coordinate well and make these adjustments, you can become a truly wonderful pair.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.sagittarius: LoveCompatEntry(score: 80, detail: 'You and your partner are lively, cheerful, and a little headstrong and self-focused. Because your personalities are so similar, you feel natural and comfortable with each other at first sight. When you come together, it’s like two unbridled horses running free—a vibrant, energetic pairing full of movement and brightness. You understand each other easily, which creates resonance and trust, and you are both capable of giving each other space, maintaining a relationship that doesn’t feel clingy. However, since you both enjoy social activities, once daily life and your interactions start to feel routine, remember to support one another and keep introducing freshness and vitality. Also, because you both cherish freedom and can be somewhat self-centered, you need to learn to let go of certain impulses and strengthen your loyalty to love. By doing so, you can become joyful partners who truly understand and treasure each other—and walking hand in hand for the long term will not be difficult at all.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.capricorn: LoveCompatEntry(score: 75, detail: 'Your partner is cautious, grounded, and ambitious, while you pursue freedom, happiness, adventure, and new experiences—so it may seem difficult for the two of you to truly align. Still, you are drawn to your partner’s strong and confident charm, and your partner genuinely appreciates your lively and cheerful nature. If you strengthen communication and take the time to truly understand each other, there is definitely hope for a meaningful relationship. In getting along, both of you need to be more considerate and empathetic—put yourselves in each other’s shoes. You can soften your partner with your innocent, playful, and lovable side, helping your partner relax; meanwhile, your partner should express thoughts more openly, truly opening up and even stepping outside to explore the world with you. Spending more time cultivating shared interests will bring you closer together and make life far more enjoyable.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.aquarius: LoveCompatEntry(score: 100, detail: 'You and your partner share a common trait—you both pursue freedom, dislike being constrained, and are willing to try new and trendy things. Because you see the world in similar ways, you naturally give each other space and time, without restricting one another, which helps build a relationship based on mutual trust. As the saying goes, “lovers cannot tolerate even a grain of sand in their eyes,” so trust is essential—and in this sense, you truly make a wonderful match. Your partner’s progressive thinking and pioneering spirit earn your admiration, while your partner is charmed by your optimism and sweetness, and absolutely adores your boldness, adventurous spirit, and free-spirited nature. If you both pay a little more attention to each other and pour even more love into the relationship, your life together will become richer and more enjoyable—and walking hand in hand through life will be more than possible.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.pisces: LoveCompatEntry(score: 70, detail: 'You are passionate and outgoing, while your partner is gentle and refined—one of you radiates vibrant energy, the other carries a tender and affectionate depth. Still, both of you are highly perceptive. You may feel deeply touched by your partner’s thoughtful and self-sacrificing care, yet sometimes feel overwhelmed by your partner’s emotional sensitivity; meanwhile, your partner admires your intelligence, optimism, and humor, but may feel insecure about your quick tongue and broad, sociable style, quietly nursing those feelings alone. In truth, your partner’s willingness to help others and reluctance to hurt anyone are qualities worth learning from. Although your partner may seem indecisive at times, your partner often sees issues from a wide perspective, which can soften your more forceful tendencies. At the same time, your optimism and cheerfulness can balance your partner’s moodiness, encouraging your partner to open up and see the world more broadly. If you both learn to appreciate each other more while reflecting on yourselves, you can certainly enjoy a harmonious and happy relationship.'),
  },
  ZodiacSignKey.capricorn: {
    ZodiacSignKey.aries: LoveCompatEntry(score: 70, detail: 'Your partner is cheerful, passionate, proactive, and freedom-loving, while you are loyal and dependable, yet also conservative and somewhat stubborn. Both of you are competitive and ambitious, but your partner may lack persistence, whereas you are strong in endurance. Your partner is not good at pretending and may find it hard to understand your quiet and steady nature, yet your patience can make up for your partner’s lack of it; in turn, your partner can soften your overly practical and rigid tendencies. When you look at it this way, there is real potential for you two to build something meaningful together. If you hope to take the relationship further, try not to be overly competitive or overly cautious—show more understanding toward your partner; meanwhile, your partner should sincerely consider your feelings and do their best to provide you with a sense of security. With more heartfelt communication, you can get along very well together.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.taurus: LoveCompatEntry(score: 95, detail: 'You and your partner are both steady and hardworking types, forming a highly harmonious and well-matched pair. Yours may not be a dramatic, stormy romance, but rather a love that flows gently and endures—like magnets naturally drawn tightly together. You share the same level of loyalty in love, giving your relationship a promising future. You can discover a thoughtful and caring side in your partner, while your partner truly appreciates your sincerity and reliability. With aligned ideas and goals, you are both willing to endure hardship and are not driven by vanity—you do not need luxury restaurants, designer brands, or imported cars to feel fulfilled, as spiritual and emotional satisfaction is enough. However, this simplicity can also hide a potential risk; it’s important to add a bit more fun, tenderness, and romance to everyday life. If you plan your future thoughtfully together, you can surely build a happy and fulfilling family.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.gemini: LoveCompatEntry(score: 65, detail: 'Your partner is lively and cheerful, while you are stubborn and traditional—your personalities are completely different. However, you do share one important trait: a strong sense of pride. At first, your partner may find your traditional nature refreshingly unique, while you may be drawn to your partner’s boundless imagination and joyful spirit. But if you want the relationship to last, you will need to learn the art of advancing by retreating—don’t always keep a stern expression; relax a little. Rather than pushing too hard, it’s wiser to handle things strategically. Your partner may sometimes seem inconsistent or changeable, almost like two different people at times, so you will need patience and the wisdom to take things in stride instead of taking them personally. If your partner can become more steady and provide you with a stronger sense of security, it will not be difficult for the two of you to grow closer, and your relationship can become much more relaxed and enjoyable.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.cancer: LoveCompatEntry(score: 80, detail: 'When you and your partner first meet, you are usually easily attracted to each other. You are captivated by your partner’s thoughtfulness and understanding nature, while your partner feels secure because of your resilience, quiet authority, and steady, cautious personality. Although aside from both being somewhat introverted and traditional, many of your traits seem opposite—and your relationship may not appear intensely passionate on the surface—you naturally grow closer and learn to rely on each other. You tend to be very strict with yourself and expect others to set aside emotions as well, so in getting along, you should try to be more open-hearted and not always so stern, or your partner may feel overwhelmed. At the same time, both of you need to communicate more: try not to be overly demanding, and your partner should also speak openly about what’s on your partner’s mind. With this mutual effort, you can build a harmonious and lasting relationship.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.leo: LoveCompatEntry(score: 60, detail: 'Your partner is masculine and somewhat domineering, while you are reserved, serious, and emotionally complex—so at first glance, you may not seem very well matched. Both of you have strong personalities and powerful ambition; the difference is that your partner competes openly, while you strategize more subtly. Your partner seeks authority and enjoys taking the lead, while you strive for achievement and reaching the peak in your own way—so both of you want to be in control. Your partner values pride and rarely gives in, while you may appear patient on the surface but are quietly planning your next move inside. Even so, you admire your partner’s sunny optimism, and although your partner may sometimes complain that you lack romance, your partner also deeply respects your resilience and commitment to staying true to yourself. If you can communicate more, adjust where needed, and consciously recognize and affirm each other’s strengths, you have strong potential to become a successful and lasting pair.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.virgo: LoveCompatEntry(score: 95, detail: 'You and your partner are not the overly romantic type—steadiness and practicality are what you truly share. Your partner’s attentiveness and thoughtfulness are especially attractive to you, while your partner appreciates your careful, steady, and thoughtful nature, as well as your sense of purpose, which gives your partner a feeling of stability and security. Both of you see each other as someone you can discuss work and future life plans with, a true long-term companion. Even in silence, you can intuitively sense each other’s feelings, showing deep mutual understanding. Although your relationship may not be filled with dramatic passion or sparks, your love can flow gently and endure over time, allowing you to stay together for the long run. Still, a small reminder: if you want your bond to grow even stronger, it’s important to set shared goals and work hard toward financial stability. With a solid foundation and your compatible personalities, lasting happiness together will be well within reach.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.libra: LoveCompatEntry(score: 65, detail: 'When you and your partner meet, you are easily drawn to each other’s contrasting qualities. The chemistry sparks quickly, but that doesn’t necessarily mean there is deep mutual appreciation. Your partner admires your poised elegance and refined, understated taste, while you are impressed by how naturally and gracefully your partner navigates social settings, handling emotions with a mysterious push-and-pull that leaves others intrigued and captivated. However, instant attraction without genuine appreciation makes it difficult to build a lifelong partnership. If you choose to be together, you will need to learn how to coordinate and complement each other. In fact, you can make an excellent team—your ambition and carefulness are qualities your partner may lack, while your partner’s social ease and relaxed approach to life are traits you can benefit from. If you cherish the connection and put in consistent effort, there is certainly a promising future ahead for both of you.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.scorpio: LoveCompatEntry(score: 90, detail: 'You and your partner have similar personalities—both of you are reserved and steady. From the very beginning, you can almost see through each other’s thoughts at a glance. When you’re together, there’s no need for pretense; the connection feels natural, comfortable, and secure. If your life goals are aligned, meeting your partner can inspire you to unlock hidden potential and step beyond rigid routines, becoming more adventurous; in turn, your partner can achieve twice the results with half the effort thanks to your shared determination and support—especially since your contribution to your partner’s work and progress should not be underestimated. That said, a gentle reminder: both of you tend to bury yourselves in hard work and keep your feelings inside. Even if you can sense each other’s emotions intuitively, a relationship still needs tenderness and affection. More open communication is essential—keeping everything bottled up can eventually lead to emotional outbursts.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.sagittarius: LoveCompatEntry(score: 75, detail: 'You are cautious, grounded, and ambitious, while your partner pursues freedom, happiness, adventure, and new experiences—so it may feel difficult for the two of you to truly align. Still, your partner is drawn to your charm and grace, and you genuinely appreciate your partner’s warmth and cheerful spirit. If you strengthen communication and take the time to understand each other more deeply, there is real hope for a lasting relationship. In getting along, both of you need to be more considerate and empathetic. Your partner can use a more playful and lighthearted side to soften you and help you relax, while you should speak your thoughts more openly, truly opening your heart and even stepping out to explore a broader world alongside your partner. Spending more time cultivating shared interests will bring you closer together and make life far more enjoyable.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.capricorn: LoveCompatEntry(score: 80, detail: 'You and your partner are highly aligned in personality, thinking style, and values. Both of you are introverted, good at concealing emotions, ambitious, practical rather than unrealistic, and a little stubborn. There is strong mutual understanding between you—you instinctively grasp each other’s motives and thoughts. You provide one another with a deep, steady sense of security, and even upon first meeting, you can feel aligned in life goals and attitudes without needing lengthy discussions. However, because both of you can be stubborn, possessive, and competitive, there may be moments when one of you acts unilaterally, which can lead to conflict. In truth, you both possess exceptional thoughtfulness and patience, giving the relationship a warm and dependable foundation. If you can establish healthy communication and speak openly and honestly about your feelings, you will be able to move forward hand in hand toward a bright and promising future.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.aquarius: LoveCompatEntry(score: 75, detail: 'You are cautious, steady, and ambitious, while your partner is rational and broad-hearted. You deeply admire intelligence and wisdom, and your partner’s rich knowledge, refreshing neutrality, humor, and calm way of handling situations easily stir your feelings; in turn, your partner appreciates your talent and strategic thinking. However, you may struggle with your partner’s broad affection—being kind to everyone can make you feel that your partner is not fully devoted—while your seriousness and high expectations may make your partner feel restricted. This means both of you need to coordinate and adjust. Your partner’s courage to explore new trends and boldly break new ground is something you can learn from, or you may appear too rigid; meanwhile, your grounded nature acts as a stabilizing force for your partner, providing much-needed security and balance. With conscious effort to harmonize and ideally cultivate shared interests and goals, your relationship can grow stronger and more fulfilling.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.pisces: LoveCompatEntry(score: 100, detail: 'Your partner is someone with ideals and dreams—thoughtful, gentle, and sensitive—making it easy for others to feel drawn to your partner. You, on the other hand, are rigorous, practical, and grounded, and you naturally feel attracted to someone like your partner. Your partner also appreciates your deep affection and devotion, which brings a strong sense of security. Both of you have relatively gentle, inward-oriented personalities, making you a highly compatible pair with complementary strengths. You tend to set goals early and work steadily toward them, though this can sometimes make you seem serious or rigid; your partner’s romantic warmth and selfless spirit are qualities you may lack but truly need. Meanwhile, your steady and methodical approach to achieving goals provides grounding and reassurance for your partner, who may be prone to dreaming and being swayed by moods or atmosphere. If you handle the relationship well, you can become a solid partnership built on mutual trust, love, and understanding.'),
  },
  ZodiacSignKey.aquarius: {
    ZodiacSignKey.aries: LoveCompatEntry(score: 85, detail: 'Your partner is passionate and energetic, while you are open-hearted and cheerful—together you form a vibrant and eye-catching pair. Your partner burns brightly with intensity, while you carry a touch of cool elegance. It is precisely because your partner finds you hard to fully grasp that you continue to fascinate your partner. You genuinely appreciate your partner’s liveliness and enthusiasm, and your partner admires your intelligence and sharp mind, making your time together full of enjoyment and shared interests. In daily interactions, your partner may sometimes seem a little childish or less mature, and that is when you can bring out your warmth and gentle kindness. At the same time, your partner should not equate your kindness toward others with your feelings toward your partner—otherwise unnecessary jealousy may arise. When your partner understands your loyalty and reliability, the relationship will feel much more secure. With this balance, the two of you can enjoy a light, happy, and harmonious connection.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.taurus: LoveCompatEntry(score: 65, detail: 'You and your partner share some similarities in temperament, yet your outlooks are quite different. Your partner is introverted, grounded, gentle, conservative, and highly practical—a true realist. You, on the other hand, are drawn to trendiness and innovation, open-hearted and imaginative, an idealist with a nontraditional spirit, which can sometimes make communication challenging. However, you may both share a deep interest in music, art, or creative expression, and these artistic connections can bring you closer together. Your thoughts can be as unpredictable as the wind, so your partner will need patience and endurance in understanding you. Your partner should also learn to appreciate your uniqueness, accept your broad-minded nature, and avoid being overly possessive; meanwhile, you should open up more, share your feelings, and have heartfelt conversations. By appreciating each other’s distinct qualities and strengths, you can improve the relationship and foster deeper emotional growth.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.gemini: LoveCompatEntry(score: 95, detail: 'You and your partner are both intelligent, progressive, and ahead of the curve—able to talk about anything from astronomy to geography, with endless topics to explore, sometimes even feeling as though you met too late in life. It’s easy for you to develop a sense of mutual understanding and appreciation, opening your hearts to one another and forming a cheerful, free-spirited pair. Being together feels natural and relaxed; you both value independence and give each other space to breathe, so there’s little pressure between you. However, since you both enjoy activity and excitement, it’s important to intentionally set aside time for each other amid busy lives. Even with strong chemistry, emotional depth still needs nurturing, or that sense of connection may gradually fade. Your partner enjoys expressing ideas and you enjoy debating them—this lively exchange is part of your harmony. As long as you trust each other and continue sharing new experiences and feelings, your love will remain vibrant and full of color.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.cancer: LoveCompatEntry(score: 70, detail: 'Your partner is emotional and guided largely by feelings, while you are rational and objective. Your partner longs for exclusive devotion and wants to protect what is loved, whereas you are broad-hearted and value loyalty and friendship deeply, believing that love does not have to be confined to just one person. Your ways of thinking are also quite opposite—your bold and visionary world may seem unbelievable to your partner. Your partner may admire your ideals and insights, yet struggle with what feels like stubbornness or inflexibility. In truth, you are well suited to begin as friends and allow friendship to gradually blossom into love. In your relationship, you could soften your cool detachment and learn from your partner’s “heart-first” approach to life; meanwhile, your partner can work toward being more calm and rational, tempering emotional reactions. With mutual adjustment, even significant differences can balance out beautifully.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.leo: LoveCompatEntry(score: 80, detail: 'Your partner is brave and outgoing, while you are calm and rational. Your partner is drawn to your uniqueness and originality, and you are attracted to your partner’s overflowing talent and fearless spirit—these qualities create a strong spark that can bring you together, so it’s worth cherishing. If you truly become a couple, you could be passionate, fiery lovers. However, one important thing to watch out for is that both of you want to take the lead, which can easily lead to clashes. If each of you insists on being right, the result may ultimately be a painful goodbye. Instead, try to understand each other, complement one another’s strengths and weaknesses, and practice mutual respect. Love requires sacrifice, generosity, and tolerance. If you can genuinely appreciate each other’s strengths and build a foundation of trust, your relationship can last for the long run.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.virgo: LoveCompatEntry(score: 60, detail: 'When you and your partner first meet, it feels like you have endless things to talk about, and being together brings genuine happiness. Your partner may be drawn to your creativity, while you admire your partner’s intelligence and wisdom. However, over time, dissatisfaction may begin to surface. Your partner is intellectual and calm, approaching everything with analysis and careful study; you, on the other hand, are curious, skilled at reasoning, and full of pioneering spirit, which creates a noticeable gap in your ways of thinking. As time goes by, you may feel that your partner is too practical and lacking imagination, even overly protective or restrictive toward you; meanwhile, your partner may see you as unrealistic. Still, if you truly want to be together, you can give more of your heart and attention to your partner, while your partner makes an effort to understand you better and avoid placing too much pressure on you. With mutual adjustment, the two of you can still look forward to a bright and promising future together.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.libra: LoveCompatEntry(score: 95, detail: 'From the moment you and your partner meet, you both deeply sense that you have found the one you’ve been dreaming of. Without needing many words, you can feel the sweetness and intensity of love, fully experiencing both loving and being loved—it truly feels like a perfect partnership. You both have restless souls, and your relationship is unique in that it feels like both lovers and close friends, balancing emotion and reason in a special way. There is strong interaction and natural chemistry between you, and once you truly begin the relationship, you are able to give each other ample space while maintaining harmony and closeness without drifting apart. However, you may sometimes become busy socializing and unintentionally neglect your partner, who needs emotional warmth and reassurance—so remember to show more care. Ideally, your partner should also be both your lover and your best friend. If you begin as friends and let the relationship grow without pressure, you can enjoy a happy connection and move steadily toward a lasting and enduring love.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.scorpio: LoveCompatEntry(score: 70, detail: 'Your partner is rigorous and practical, while you value freedom and tend to be more idealistic. There is an elusive attraction between you, sometimes even an electric spark in certain moments. However, your differences are significant. Your partner may see your broad-hearted nature as a lack of exclusivity and think your ideas are unrealistic fantasies; meanwhile, you may feel that your partner is overly jealous and possessive, making you feel restricted and suffocated. Even so, if you genuinely want to be together, there is still real hope. In fact, both of you are strong-willed and determined, with a powerful drive to stay true to your convictions and surpass yourselves. It would help greatly to create shared goals and mutual interests that you can work toward together. If you focus on these common strengths, you still have a strong chance of becoming a lasting and committed pair.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.sagittarius: LoveCompatEntry(score: 100, detail: 'You and your partner share a key trait—you both pursue freedom, dislike being restrained, and are willing to try new and trendy things. Because you think alike in this way, you naturally give each other space and time, without limiting one another, which helps build a relationship rooted in mutual trust. As the saying goes, “lovers cannot tolerate even a grain of sand in their eyes,” so trust is essential—and in that sense, you truly make a wonderful match. Your progressive thinking and pioneering spirit earn your partner’s admiration, while you are charmed by your partner’s optimism and humor—you absolutely adore your partner’s bold, adventurous, and free-spirited nature. If you both pay a little more attention to each other and pour more love into the relationship, your life together will become even more meaningful and enjoyable, and walking hand in hand through life will be more than achievable.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.capricorn: LoveCompatEntry(score: 75, detail: 'Your partner is cautious, steady, and ambitious, while you are rational and broad-hearted. Your partner admires intelligence and wisdom, and your rich knowledge, fresh and neutral charm, humor, and calm way of handling situations easily touch your partner’s heart; in turn, you appreciate your partner’s talent and strategic thinking. However, your partner may struggle with your broad affection and kindness toward everyone, seeing it as a lack of exclusivity, while your partner’s seriousness and high expectations can sometimes feel restrictive to you. This means both of you need to make adjustments and find balance. In fact, your partner’s grounded nature can serve as your stabilizing force, giving you a stronger sense of security, while your courage to explore new trends and boldly break new ground is something your partner can learn from—otherwise your partner may become too rigid. With more coordination and, ideally, shared interests and common goals, your relationship can grow stronger and more harmonious.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.aquarius: LoveCompatEntry(score: 80, detail: 'From the very first meeting, you and your partner feel a deep sense of mutual understanding and appreciation. Even without words, affection flows naturally between you. Your relationship feels like that of longtime friends—gentle and understated, yet enduring and meaningful. If you choose to build a life together, you can strive side by side and enjoy life together, expanding each other’s horizons; in marriage, you would make an inseparable and well-coordinated team. However, a gentle reminder: since both of you enjoy trying new things and exploring mysteries, over time you may unintentionally neglect romance and let the spark fade. It’s important for both of you to be more thoughtful toward each other, adding touches of romance and sweet words to everyday life. With that effort, your shared life will become even more colorful, lively, and full of delightful surprises.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.pisces: LoveCompatEntry(score: 75, detail: 'You are pioneering, broad-hearted, and visionary, while your partner is dreamy and artistically inclined. Your partner’s empathy, gentleness, and thoughtful care are qualities you truly appreciate, and your courage to try new things, independence, and foresight are irresistibly attractive to your partner. However, your partner can be sensitive and prone to melancholy, which may feel a bit heavy for someone like you who prioritizes reason over emotion; at the same time, your logical approach to life and strong desire for freedom can sometimes make you seem distant or inconsistent, unintentionally leaving your partner feeling hurt. In truth, if your partner can build more confidence, you can help unlock your partner’s hidden potential, while your partner’s artistic spirit can inspire you and bring more romance into your life. If you approach the relationship as true partners—supporting and complementing each other’s weaknesses—you can enjoy a light, harmonious, and mutually enriching connection.'),
  },
  ZodiacSignKey.pisces: {
    ZodiacSignKey.aries: LoveCompatEntry(score: 75, detail: 'Your partner is outgoing and passionate, while you are shy and sometimes lack confidence. Your partner’s bold and assertive nature deeply attracts you, and your romantic spirit is something your partner longs for. However, your partner’s occasional inconsistency in love may make you feel jealous or quietly upset, while your emotional ups and downs and sensitivity can sometimes overwhelm your partner. Still, these differences can actually balance and complement each other. In general, your interactions tend to be warm and kind. You may feel intimidated by your partner’s bluntness, so for the relationship to flourish, your partner should soften any domineering tendencies and gently guide you into your partner’s inner world, allowing you to experience those bright dreams and aspirations. Combined with your natural romantic touch, this can create a deep spiritual connection between you. If you treat each other fairly and with mutual respect, your journey in love can last much longer and grow even stronger.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.taurus: LoveCompatEntry(score: 90, detail: 'You and your partner both tend to follow your hearts, and your relationship usually develops in a gentle, low-pressure atmosphere. After the initial stage of getting to know each other, your feelings naturally deepen over time—your partner’s resilience combined with your tenderness creates a warm and affectionate bond built on mutual appreciation. In your partner’s eyes, you are kind and gracious; in turn, you value your partner’s steadiness and reliability, which give you a strong sense of security. You can learn from your partner’s grounded and practical approach, helping you avoid drifting too far into unrealistic dreams, while your partner can benefit from your intuitive and reflective sensitivity, preventing life from becoming overly material or purely practical. Your personalities complement each other beautifully, creating a balanced and mutually supportive dynamic. Even so, it’s important to maintain open communication to prevent extreme differences in perspective from growing into conflicts that are hard to resolve.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.gemini: LoveCompatEntry(score: 70, detail: 'Being changeable and freedom-loving is something you and your partner share. The difference is that your partner has sharp intuition, while you are emotionally sensitive and deeply affectionate. In your partner’s eyes, you may seem insecure, self-sacrificing, somewhat indecisive, and emotionally vulnerable; meanwhile, you may feel that your partner is always chasing something new, lacking stability, and unable to give you a solid sense of security. However, if you both make good use of your shared love of freedom and adaptability, you can add variety and depth to your lives together, and strengthen your emotional bond through deeper communication. This can also help your partner avoid being too superficial in actions, while reducing your tendency to suppress your true feelings or drift along without expressing yourself. With mutual awareness and growth, the two of you can indeed become a wonderfully harmonious pair.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.cancer: LoveCompatEntry(score: 95, detail: 'From the very first meeting, you and your partner may feel love at first sight—mutually attracted and naturally blending into one another. Yours is a deeply romantic and lingering connection. Your partner is caring and compassionate, someone who enjoys helping and taking care of others, while you are someone who truly knows how to appreciate your partner. Being together brings a sense of genuine happiness. You are likely gentle and humble in nature, absorbing your partner’s frustrations like a sponge and offering quiet understanding. Both of you are emotionally sensitive, which makes it easy to fall in love. However, since you are both tender and feeling-oriented, your moods can fluctuate, so adding a bit more rational balance, optimism, and confidence will help. You can show even more thoughtfulness and warmth so your partner feels cherished, while your partner can encourage your artistic talents and offer you emotional support. With this mutual nurturing, your relationship can become even more beautiful and complete.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.leo: LoveCompatEntry(score: 65, detail: 'Your partner is bold and passionate, while you are gentle and refined. At first, you may be attracted to each other’s differences, but as you spend more time together, you may realize that your personalities are not naturally in sync, and true complementarity may not come easily. Still, if you genuinely care for your partner, you will need to overcome some of your softness and express your intentions and thoughts clearly—otherwise, your partner may feel brushed off or think you are being vague, which could hurt your partner’s pride and strong sense of dignity. At the same time, your partner should let go of a bit of pride and offer you more tenderness and romance. In this relationship, you need to learn to face issues directly rather than avoiding them, while your partner should avoid being overly dominant. If both of you put in sincere effort, you can gradually close the distance and build a stronger connection.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.virgo: LoveCompatEntry(score: 80, detail: 'Your partner is serious and strives for perfection, while you are intuitive and imaginative—two completely different types. Precisely because of these differences, a strong attraction can easily arise between you. However, once you truly begin spending time together, areas of friction may also appear. Your partner admires your romantic aura yet may feel frustrated by what seems like carelessness or extravagance; meanwhile, your partner’s thoughtfulness, careful consideration, and sincerity deeply move you, though you may sometimes feel constrained by your partner’s rigid and methodical ways. This calls for mutual respect, patience, and open-hearted tolerance. Face each other calmly, appreciate each other’s strengths, and learn to make up for your own shortcomings. You can show greater consistency and sincerity in how you treat your partner, while your partner can value your artistic temperament more and avoid being so practical that it shatters your dreams. With this balance, you can truly become a beautifully matched pair.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.libra: LoveCompatEntry(score: 60, detail: 'On the surface, you and your partner both appear gentle, yet neither of you is entirely steady at heart—you are actually people from two different worlds. You are both easy to be loved and quick to fall in love, which can create a sense of instability when you are together. However, if you truly choose to love each other, you can become a deeply romantic and creative pair. As tender-hearted romantics, you naturally attract one another. As long as you both offer more support and a greater sense of security, the relationship can become much more stable. It’s important to communicate more and bridge your natural differences with understanding. By putting yourselves in each other’s shoes and considering each other’s perspectives, it won’t be difficult to grow closer and build a harmonious, balanced relationship.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.scorpio: LoveCompatEntry(score: 95, detail: 'You and your partner are both highly sensitive and intuitive. Without needing many words, a glance or simple body language is enough to express everything—you truly connect on a soul-deep level. Your gentle nature, rich imagination, and selfless spirit are exactly what your partner—who is devoted and somewhat possessive—longs for. At the same time, you tend to be accommodating and soft-hearted, and you admire your partner’s calm lifestyle and composed authority, especially the ability to refuse meaningless matters without anger yet with quiet strength. Even though you fit together beautifully, there are still things to be mindful of: you can strengthen your resilience, because avoiding issues rarely solves them; your partner should also offer you more care and emotional support, so you don’t feel neglected or hurt. Adding a touch of romance and playfulness to your otherwise peaceful and steady life will help your love remain both sweet and enduring.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.sagittarius: LoveCompatEntry(score: 70, detail: 'Your partner is passionate and outgoing, while you are gentle and refined—one radiates vibrant energy, the other carries tender depth. Still, both of you are highly perceptive. Your partner may be deeply touched by your gentle, self-sacrificing care, yet sometimes feel overwhelmed by your emotional sensitivity; meanwhile, you admire your partner’s intelligence, optimism, and humor, but your partner’s blunt speech and expansive social style may leave you feeling insecure and quietly hurt. In truth, your partner’s optimism can balance your sensitivity, helping you open your heart and broaden your perspective. Likewise, your compassionate nature and reluctance to hurt others are qualities your partner can learn from. Even if you sometimes seem indecisive, your wide perspective can soften your partner’s more forceful tendencies. If both of you focus on appreciating each other’s strengths while reflecting on your own shortcomings, you can build a happy and harmonious relationship together.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.capricorn: LoveCompatEntry(score: 100, detail: 'You are someone with ideals and dreams—thoughtful, gentle, and sensitive—making it easy for others to feel drawn to you. Your partner, on the other hand, is rigorous, practical, and grounded, and is especially attracted to someone like you. You also appreciate your partner’s deep affection and devotion, which give you a strong sense of security. Both of you have gentle, inward-oriented personalities, making you a highly compatible and complementary pair. Your partner tends to set goals early and move steadily forward, sometimes appearing serious or rigid; your romantic warmth and selfless spirit are qualities your partner may lack but truly needs. Meanwhile, your partner’s steady, step-by-step approach to achieving goals provides reassurance for you, especially when you are prone to dreaming or being carried away by the atmosphere. If you handle the relationship well, you can become a solid partnership built on mutual trust, love, and understanding.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.aquarius: LoveCompatEntry(score: 75, detail: 'Your partner is pioneering, broad-minded, and visionary, while you are dreamy and artistically inclined; your empathy and gentle thoughtfulness are exactly what draw your partner to you, and in turn, your partner’s courage to explore new horizons, independence, and foresight are irresistibly attractive to you. However, you tend to be more sensitive and emotionally delicate, which can feel overwhelming when paired with someone who prioritizes logic and reason over emotion, and your partner’s rational, freedom-loving nature may sometimes seem inconsistent—warm one moment and distant the next—leaving you feeling hurt or unsettled. In truth, if you grow more confident, your partner can help unlock your potential, while your artistic sensitivity and romantic spirit can soften your partner’s rational edge and bring more warmth into the relationship. If you approach love as partners—supporting each other and balancing out each other’s weaknesses—you will find the relationship light, harmonious, and genuinely fulfilling.'),
    ZodiacSignKey.pisces: LoveCompatEntry(score: 80, detail: 'You and your partner are a very gentle and sensitive pairing, with your joys and sorrows flowing directly from your inner emotions; both of you are romantic and intuitive, making it easy to feel an instant connection. Your emotional shifts are clearly reflected in one another, creating a comforting sense of “you understand exactly what I feel,” and that mutual understanding brings deep reassurance. You both love romance and dreaming, and you share a compassionate spirit, always willing to help others and even sacrifice for those in need. However, when it comes to facing your own real-life challenges, you may both tend to avoid them or struggle with self-confidence—especially when you are together, which can make things more complicated. If you encourage and support each other, open your hearts, and spend time in sincere, heartfelt conversations, your relationship will grow stronger, and your chances of staying deeply in love for the long run will be even greater.'),
  },
};

/// Convert UI string ("Capricorn") -> enum
ZodiacSignKey zodiacKeyFromName(String signName) {
  final s = signName.trim().toLowerCase().replaceAll(' ', '_');
  return ZodiacSignKey.values.firstWhere(
    (e) => e.name == s,
    orElse: () => throw ArgumentError('Unknown zodiac sign: $signName'),
  );
}

/// Safe directional lookup
LoveCompatEntry? getLoveCompat(String yourSign, String partnerSign) {
  final you = zodiacKeyFromName(yourSign);
  final partner = zodiacKeyFromName(partnerSign);
  return loveCompatData[you]?[partner];
}